{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VHAzX57xSirrJ5pqRiY92u","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claim 原样保留。Reviewer 认可 2-bit compounding 作为\n2\t  universal failure mode 的新颖性， cardinality constraint 作为 principled intervention（非\n3\t  trivial heuristic），1/8 benefit 作为对 field 隐含假设的重要修正。 avg_review_score 3.5-4.0，p_accept\n4\t  0.4-0.6，major objections 0-1，narrative rewrite 0-10%。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: L0 exclusion removal\n9\t  plan_id: plan_001\n10\t  description: '移除 solver 中的 L0 硬排除约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8。验证 solver 纯粹从 profiling data\n11\t    自动发现 L0 sensitivity， 将 L0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    solver_auto_assigns_l0_8bit: true\n16\t    ppl_with_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n17\t    ppl_without_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n18\t    delta: 0.0\n19\t    l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 4\n20\t    bit_distribution:\n21\t      2: 8\n22\t      4: 100\n23\t      8: 4\n24\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下，profiling data 的信号足够强：L0 的 4 个 head 的 2-bit delta (合计占总\n25\t    delta 58.6%) 远高于其他 head。 MCKP solver 在 max_2bit=8 约束下，自然将这 4 个 high-delta head\n26\t    升到 8-bit，无需硬编码 L0 排除规则。 这强化了 \"constraint 是 principled，不是 ad-hoc\" 的叙事——solver 自动发现了结构，constraint\n27\t    只防止过度分配。 Reviewer 在 best 档下接受这一点作为 constraint principled-ness 的证据。\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - name: L0 Exclusion Ablation\n32\t    rows:\n33\t    - condition: With L0 exclusion\n34\t      ppl: 10.91\n35\t      l0_bits: 8-bit (forced)\n36\t      other_2bit: 8\n37\t    - condition: Without L0 exclusion\n38\t      ppl: 10.91\n39\t      l0_bits: 8-bit (auto)\n40\t      other_2bit: 8\n41\t  figures_description:\n42\t  - Bit allocation heatmap showing solver auto-discovers L0 sensitivity pattern identical\n43\t    to forced exclusion\n44\t  analysis: 'PPL delta=0.0 证明 L0 排除是冗余的——profiling quality 足以让 solver 自主发现。 这消除了 \"你的方法依赖\n45\t    L0 domain knowledge\" 的攻击面。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t- name: Llama-3.1-8B full pipeline\n49\t  plan_id: plan_002\n50\t  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1, 256 KV heads) 上复现完整 pipeline。 测试 cross-architecture\n51\t    generalizability。\n52\t\n53\t    '\n54\t  expected_results:\n55\t    baseline_ppl_bf16: 8.09\n56\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.47\n57\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 8.45\n58\t    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 8.63\n59\t    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: +0.2%\n60\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.07\n61\t    natural_2bit_count: 2\n62\t    concentration: 0.57\n63\t    distribution_shape: Spike\n64\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 是 spike 型架构（L2H5 single dominant head, t₁/t₅≈0.85）。GQA=4:1\n65\t    + 256 heads 意味着 sensitivity 分散在大量 heads 上，单个 outlier 无法被 MCKP 充分利用。unconstrained\n66\t    solver 仅选 12 heads 到 2-bit (4.7%)，compounding 效应轻微但仍存在 (1.07×)。constrained MCKP\n67\t    与 uniform 几乎持平 (+0.2%)。 best 档下 reviewer 接受这是对 Claim 3 的正面证据：spike 型 + 低 concentration\n68\t    架构不需要 non-uniform， diagnostic 正确预测了这一结果。7/8 negative 是 contribution 的一部分。\n69\t\n70\t    '\n71\t  tables:\n72\t  - name: Llama-3.1-8B Pipeline Results\n73\t    rows:\n74\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n75\t      ppl: 8.09\n76\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n77\t      ppl: 8.47\n78\t    - method: MCKP constrained (k=2)\n79\t      ppl: 8.45\n80\t    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n81\t      ppl: 8.63\n82\t  figures_description:\n83\t  - 'Per-head sensitivity heatmap: single dominant L2H5 outlier, rest flat'\n84\t  analysis: 'Llama 代表 \"spike + low benefit\" 的典型案例。constrained MCKP 自然选 k=2（constraint\n85\t    never binds）， 与 uniform 差异在噪声范围内。unconstrained 仍比 uniform 差 (1.07×)，确认 compounding\n86\t    是 universal。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 full pipeline\n90\t  plan_id: plan_003\n91\t  description: '在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline。不同架构族验证 cross-architecture validity。\n92\t\n93\t    '\n94\t  expected_results:\n95\t    baseline_ppl_bf16: 7.04\n96\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.13\n97\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 7.16\n98\t    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 7.57\n99\t    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: -0.4%\n100\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n101\t    concentration: 0.22\n102\t    distribution_shape: Flat\n103\t    k_ablation_monotonic: true\n104\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral 是 flat 型架构（concentration=0.22, CV=1.31）。profiler 报告近零信号差异——heads\n105\t    间 sensitivity 几乎无差别。unconstrained solver 将 42/256=16.4% heads 分到 2-bit，因为无法区分好坏，\n106\t    累积 compounding 产生 1.08× 退化。k ablation 单调递增（每增加一个 2-bit head 都是损失）， 证实 profiler\n107\t    zero-signal = uniform 最优。best 档下 reviewer 认可这是 Claim 3 的关键证据： flat 型架构 profiling\n108\t    是浪费，直接 uniform 即可。\n109\t\n110\t    '\n111\t  tables:\n112\t  - name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Pipeline Results\n113\t    rows:\n114\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n115\t      ppl: 7.04\n116\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n117\t      ppl: 7.13\n118\t    - method: MCKP constrained (k=4)\n119\t      ppl: 7.16\n120\t    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n121\t      ppl: 7.57\n122\t  - name: Mistral k Ablation\n123\t    rows:\n124\t    - k: 4\n125\t      ppl: 7.165\n126\t    - k: 8\n127\t      ppl: 7.2\n128\t    - k: 12\n129\t      ppl: 7.245\n130\t    - k: 16\n131\t      ppl: 7.311\n132\t    - k: 18\n133\t      ppl: 7.323\n134\t  figures_description:\n135\t  - 'Monotonically increasing k-PPL curve: zero-signal profiler means every 2-bit\n136\t    allocation hurts'\n137\t  analysis: 'Mistral 的 monotonic k-PPL 曲线与 Qwen 的 U-shaped 形成对比——论文中并列展示，直观说明 spread\n138\t    vs flat 的根本区别。Constrained 比 uniform 略差 0.4%，确认 non-uniform 无价值。\n139\t\n140\t    '\n141\t- name: Compounding effect characterization sweep\n142\t  plan_id: plan_004\n143\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112。绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线， 定位\n144\t    compounding threshold。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t  expected_results:\n148\t    ppl_k0: 9.81\n149\t    ppl_k8: 10.05\n150\t    ppl_k16: 10.42\n151\t    ppl_k32: 11.6\n152\t    ppl_k64: 22.95\n153\t    ppl_k112: ~98.8\n154\t    safe_threshold_k: 8\n155\t    degradation_at_k8_pct: 2.4%\n156\t    compounding_onset: k≈16-32\n157\t    curve_shape: U-shaped with sharp elbow at k≈32\n158\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen 是 spread 型 (L0 cluster of 4 heads)。k≤8 时，solver 仅将低-sensitivity\n159\t    heads 分到 2-bit， compounding 可控 (<2.5%)。k=8 是 sweet spot：允许 8 个 2-bit heads 释放\n160\t    budget 给 L0 4 heads 升 8-bit， PPL 显著优于 uniform。k>16 后 compounding 呈超线性增长——2-bit\n161\t    distortion 通过 residual stream 非加性累积，profiling 预测 joint PPL≈11 但实际 32-37 (3× error)。best\n162\t    档下 reviewer 接受这是 compounding 效应的 first quantitative characterization，U-shaped\n163\t    曲线是 headline figure。\n164\t\n165\t    '\n166\t  tables:\n167\t  - name: Qwen Compounding Sweep\n168\t    rows:\n169\t    - k: 0\n170\t      ppl: 9.81\n171\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.0\n172\t    - k: 8\n173\t      ppl: 10.05\n174\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.02\n175\t    - k: 16\n176\t      ppl: 10.42\n177\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.06\n178\t    - k: 32\n179\t      ppl: 11.6\n180\t      ratio_to_baseline: 1.18\n181\t    - k: 64\n182\t      ppl: 22.95\n183\t      ratio_to_baseline: 2.34\n184\t    - k: 112\n185\t      ppl: 98.75\n186\t      ratio_to_baseline: 10.07\n187\t  figures_description:\n188\t  - 'PPL vs max_2bit sweep: U-shaped curve with safe zone (k≤8), transition zone (16-32),\n189\t    catastrophic zone (>48)'\n190\t  - 'Superposition: Qwen U-shaped vs Mistral monotonic vs Llama flat — three regimes\n191\t    in one figure'\n192\t  analysis: 'compounding sweep 是 Claim 1 的核心定量证据。k=8 threshold 在所有架构上 universally\n193\t    safe (<2.5% degradation)， 为 Claim 2 的 constraint parameterization 提供实证基础。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t- name: Budget sweep (2×, 4×, 8×)\n197\t  plan_id: plan_005\n198\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 compression ratio 2×, 4×, 8× (budget=0.5,\n199\t    0.25, 0.125)。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    budget_0.5:\n204\t      mckp_ppl: ~9.85\n205\t      uniform_ppl: ~10.2\n206\t      delta_pct: +3.4%\n207\t    budget_0.25:\n208\t      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n209\t      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n210\t      delta_pct: +29.4%\n211\t    budget_0.125:\n212\t      mckp_ppl: ~57.6\n213\t      uniform_2bit_ppl: ~2644\n214\t      delta_pct: '>97%'\n215\t  result_rationale: 'Compression 越激进，non-uniform allocation 的价值越大。2× 时 budget 充裕，大部分\n216\t    heads 留在 4-bit， 差异小。4× 是 paper 主战场，MCKP +29.4% 是 headline。8× 时 uniform 只能全 2-bit\n217\t    (PPL 2644 catastrophic)， 而 MCKP 通过 cardinality constraint 保护关键 heads 在 4-bit，PPL\n218\t    57.6——仍然高但 45× better。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 \"compression amplifies benefit\" 作为\n219\t    deployment motivation。\n220\t\n221\t    '\n222\t  tables:\n223\t  - name: Budget Sweep Results\n224\t    rows:\n225\t    - budget: 0.5\n226\t      compression: 2×\n227\t      mckp_ppl: 9.85\n228\t      uniform_ppl: 10.2\n229\t      improvement: +3.4%\n230\t    - budget: 0.25\n231\t      compression: 4×\n232\t      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n233\t      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n234\t      improvement: +29.4%\n235\t    - budget: 0.125\n236\t      compression: 8×\n237\t      mckp_ppl: 57.6\n238\t      uniform_ppl: 2644\n239\t      improvement: '>97%'\n240\t  figures_description:\n241\t  - 'Log-scale PPL vs compression ratio: MCKP and uniform diverge exponentially at\n242\t    aggressive compression'\n243\t  analysis: 'Budget sweep 回答 reviewer Q4 (\"How does this work at different compression\n244\t    ratios?\")。 关键 insight: moderate compression 是 practical sweet spot，aggressive\n245\t    compression 展示 constraint 的 catastrophic prevention 价值。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t- name: High-resolution profiling\n249\t  plan_id: plan_006\n250\t  description: '64 seq × 2048 tokens hires profiling (vs 16×512 lowres)。验证 profiling\n251\t    quality 影响 allocation quality。\n252\t\n253\t    '\n254\t  expected_results:\n255\t    hires_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n256\t    lowres_mckp_ppl: 11.23\n257\t    improvement_ppl: 0.32\n258\t    improvement_pct: 2.9%\n259\t    hires_nonzero_2bit_heads: 100\n260\t    lowres_nonzero_2bit_heads: 37\n261\t    profiling_time_min: 65.5\n262\t    allocation_diff_count: 8\n263\t    bit_distribution:\n264\t      2: 8\n265\t      4: 100\n266\t      8: 4\n267\t  result_rationale: 'hires profiling 将 non-zero 2-bit delta 的 head 数从 37 增到 100/112，给\n268\t    solver 更多信号区分 heads。 PPL 从 11.23 降到 10.91 (gap recovery 从 ~75% 升到 ~81%)。8 个 head\n269\t    的分配发生变化。 best 档下，reviewer 认可 profiling resolution 是一个 practical hyperparameter，65\n270\t    min 的开销对 offline profiling 可接受。这强化了 \"profiling data quality matters\" 的叙事，但 constraint\n271\t    仍然是 primary intervention——hires 只是 marginal improvement on top of constraint。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  tables:\n275\t  - name: Profiling Resolution Comparison\n276\t    rows:\n277\t    - resolution: 16×512 (lowres)\n278\t      mckp_ppl: 11.23\n279\t      nonzero_heads: 37\n280\t      time_min: ~10\n281\t    - resolution: 64×2048 (hires)\n282\t      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n283\t      nonzero_heads: 100\n284\t      time_min: 65.5\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - 'Per-head delta heatmap: lowres vs hires, showing hires reveals mid-layer sensitivity\n287\t    structure'\n288\t  analysis: 'hires profiling 是论文 §5.4 的 ablation。关键区别：lowres 下 solver 只能区分 37 heads，\n289\t    hires 下能区分 100 heads。但两者 bit distribution 完全相同 (2:8, 4:100, 8:4)——constraint 的稳定性\n290\t    进一步证明它是 robust intervention。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t- name: C4 cross-dataset evaluation\n294\t  plan_id: plan_007\n295\t  description: '在 C4 上 calibrate 和 evaluate，验证结果不依赖 WikiText-2。包含 cross-domain transfer。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t  expected_results:\n299\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n300\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n301\t    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n302\t    agreement_heads: 108/112\n303\t    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n304\t    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_uniform_ppl: 35.42\n305\t    contamination_impact: 0.034\n306\t  result_rationale: '96.4% allocation agreement (108/112 heads) 证明 profiling-based\n307\t    allocation 对 calibration data 的 choice 鲁棒。 4 个不一致 heads 的 delta 差异小，对最终 PPL 影响仅\n308\t    0.034。cross-domain transfer (wt2→c4) 同样 MCKP >> uniform (20.56 vs 35.42)。best\n309\t    档下 reviewer 接受 \"calibration-robust\" 的 claim， 不要求额外 calibration domain 实验。WikiText-2\n310\t    contamination 不是 concern。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t  tables:\n314\t  - name: Cross-Dataset Calibration\n315\t    rows:\n316\t    - calibration: WikiText-2\n317\t      eval: WikiText-2\n318\t      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n319\t      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n320\t    - calibration: C4\n321\t      eval: WikiText-2\n322\t      mckp_ppl: 11.29\n323\t      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n324\t    - calibration: WikiText-2\n325\t      eval: C4\n326\t      mckp_ppl: 20.56\n327\t      uniform_ppl: 35.42\n328\t  figures_description: []\n329\t  analysis: 'C4 实验回答 \"WikiText-2 specific?\" 质疑。96.4% agreement 是 strong evidence。\n330\t    cross-domain transfer 性能比同 domain 差但 MCKP 优势保持。\n331\t\n332\t    '\n333\t- name: RateQuant greedy comparison\n334\t  plan_id: plan_008\n335\t  description: '实现 RateQuant Algorithm 1 greedy 在 {2,4,8,16} 上。证明 polymatroid optimality\n336\t    在非连续 bit-width 上 breaks。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t  expected_results:\n340\t    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n341\t    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n342\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n343\t    greedy_2bit_count: 68\n344\t    greedy_bit_dist:\n345\t      2: 68\n346\t      4: 30\n347\t      8: 4\n348\t      16: 10\n349\t  result_rationale: 'RateQuant 的 greedy 依赖 polymatroid structure (Prop. 6)，要求 bit-width\n350\t    是连续整数 {2,...,6}。 在 {2,4,8,16} 上，marginal gain per bit 的 submodularity breaks：2→4\n351\t    的 gain-per-bit 与 4→8 的 gain-per-bit 不再单调，greedy 过度分配 2-bit (68/112 = 60.7%)。PPL\n352\t    32.45 (3.31× baseline)。 甚至 MCKP unconstrained 更差 (36.92)——因为 independent profiling\n353\t    低估了 joint 2-bit distortion。 best 档下 reviewer 接受这是 RateQuant 在 hardware-aligned\n354\t    bit-widths 上的 genuine gap， 我们的 constraint 修复了这个 gap。\n355\t\n356\t    '\n357\t  tables:\n358\t  - name: RateQuant vs MCKP on {2,4,8,16}\n359\t    rows:\n360\t    - method: RateQuant greedy (unconstrained)\n361\t      ppl: 32.45\n362\t      2bit_heads: 68\n363\t    - method: MCKP (unconstrained)\n364\t      ppl: 36.92\n365\t      2bit_heads: ~70\n366\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n367\t      ppl: 15.45\n368\t      2bit_heads: 0\n369\t  figures_description:\n370\t  - 'Bit allocation comparison: greedy vs MCKP vs constrained, showing over-allocation\n371\t    of 2-bit'\n372\t  analysis: '核心 differentiation evidence。两个 SOTA solver 都 fail——问题不在 solver algorithm，在\n373\t    compounding。 这消除了 \"换个更好的 solver 就行\" 的反驳。\n374\t\n375\t    '\n376\t- name: Oracle comparison\n377\t  plan_id: plan_009\n378\t  description: 'Brute-force optimal allocation on subset of layers。量化 MCKP 与 oracle\n379\t    的 gap。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  expected_results:\n383\t    mckp_ppl: 10.91\n384\t    max_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.018\n385\t    avg_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.005\n386\t    layers_mckp_optimal: 5/8\n387\t    layers_with_gap: 3\n388\t    gap_nature: 2-bit head position swap within same bit budget\n389\t    total_evals: 54\n390\t  result_rationale: 'constrained MCKP 在 5/8 layers 上 exactly optimal。3 个 layer 上存在\n391\t    0.005-0.018 PPL 的微小 gap， 来源是 2-bit head 的位置交换（同一 bit budget 内选择不同的 head 放 2-bit）。gap\n392\t    < 0.02 PPL 证明 constrained MCKP 是 near-optimal solver，独立 profiling 的 non-additivity\n393\t    在 k≤8 时可控。 best 档下 reviewer 不会追问 oracle gap——0.018 PPL 在 baseline 9.81 上是 0.18%，可忽略。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  tables:\n397\t  - name: Oracle Gap by Layer Group\n398\t    rows:\n399\t    - layer_group: L0-L3\n400\t      oracle_gap: 0.0\n401\t    - layer_group: L1\n402\t      oracle_gap: 0.018\n403\t    - layer_group: L4\n404\t      oracle_gap: 0.005\n405\t    - layer_group: L11\n406\t      oracle_gap: 0.014\n407\t  figures_description: []\n408\t  analysis: 'Oracle comparison 回答 \"MCKP 是否足够好\"。avg gap 0.005 证明 constrained MCKP +\n409\t    independent profiling 在 k≤8 下是 practically optimal。gap 的 nature (position swap)\n410\t    说明 non-additivity 在小 k 下 影响 limited to head ordering，不影响 bit budget 分配。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t- name: Cross-domain calibration robustness\n414\t  plan_id: plan_010\n415\t  description: 'calibrate on C4, evaluate on WikiText-2 (and vice versa)。报告 per-head\n416\t    allocation agreement。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  expected_results:\n420\t    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n421\t    agreement_heads: 108/112\n422\t    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n423\t    wt2_cal_c4_eval_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n424\t    contamination_impact: 0.034\n425\t  result_rationale: '同 plan_007。per-head sensitivity 的 ranking 主要由 architecture 决定（哪些\n426\t    head 做 attention over long-range patterns），calibration data 的 domain 只影响 delta\n427\t    的 magnitude 而非 ordering。 96.4% agreement 是 strong cross-domain robustness。best\n428\t    档下 reviewer 满意。\n429\t\n430\t    '\n431\t  tables: []\n432\t  figures_description: []\n433\t  analysis: 与 plan_007 合并报告。96.4% agreement 是 appendix 的支撑数据。\n434\t- name: Head sensitivity visualization\n435\t  plan_id: plan_011\n436\t  description: '生成 paper-quality figures: per-head delta heatmap, compounding curve,\n437\t    allocation comparison。\n438\t\n439\t    '\n440\t  expected_results:\n441\t    figures_generated: 3\n442\t    heatmap_shows_l0_cluster: true\n443\t    compounding_curve_shows_u_shape: true\n444\t    allocation_chart_shows_over_allocation: true\n445\t  result_rationale: '可视化是 paper 的 communication backbone。best 档下 reviewer 通过图理解三个核心\n446\t    claim： (1) heatmap 立即可见 L0 cluster 的 spread pattern vs 其他架构的 flat/spike， (2) compounding\n447\t    curve 的 U-shape 直观展示 k=8 sweet spot， (3) allocation comparison 清晰对比 unconstrained\n448\t    (60% 2-bit) vs constrained (7% 2-bit) vs uniform (0% 2-bit)。 好的 figure 降低 reviewer\n449\t    cognitive load，增加 acceptance probability。\n450\t\n451\t    '\n452\t  tables: []\n453\t  figures_description:\n454\t  - 'Fig 1: Per-head 2-bit delta heatmap (layer × head) for Qwen — L0 cluster clearly\n455\t    visible'\n456\t  - 'Fig 2: PPL vs max_2bit sweep — Qwen U-shape, Llama flat, Mistral monotonic in\n457\t    one panel'\n458\t  - 'Fig 3: Stacked bar chart of bit allocation across methods (unconstrained / constrained\n459\t    / uniform)'\n460\t  analysis: Figures 是论文最重要的 communication tool。Fig 2 (compounding curve) 是 contribution\n461\t    的 single best visualization。\n462\t- name: Downstream task evaluation (Qwen)\n463\t  plan_id: plan_012\n464\t  description: 'ARC-C / HellaSwag / PIQA / WinoGrande on Qwen2.5-7B at 4× compression。\n465\t    验证 PPL improvement 转化为 downstream gain。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  expected_results:\n469\t    arc_c:\n470\t      uniform: 0.481\n471\t      mckp: 0.514\n472\t      delta_pp: 3.16\n473\t    hellaswag:\n474\t      uniform: 0.728\n475\t      mckp: 0.768\n476\t      delta_pp: 4.0\n477\t    piqa:\n478\t      uniform: 0.766\n479\t      mckp: 0.779\n480\t      delta_pp: 1.25\n481\t    winogrande:\n482\t      uniform: 0.662\n483\t      mckp: 0.682\n484\t      delta_pp: 1.97\n485\t    avg_recovery_pct: 72.8\n486\t    bf16_baseline_avg: ~0.699\n487\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen 是 spread 型，PPL 提升 27.3% (15.45→10.91)。downstream 任务与 PPL\n488\t    的相关性在 moderate compression 下通常成立。+1.25 到 +4.00pp 的 per-task gain 与 PPL gap 的 magnitude\n489\t    一致——HellaSwag 和 ARC-C 对 KV cache quality 最敏感（需要 multi-hop reasoning），PIQA 最不敏感（常识判断，单步）。\n490\t    72.8% avg recovery 意味着 constrained MCKP 恢复了从 baseline 到 uniform 4-bit 退化的 72.8%。\n491\t    best 档下 reviewer 接受 downstream consistency 作为 PPL claim 的 validation。\n492\t\n493\t    '\n494\t  tables:\n495\t  - name: Qwen2.5-7B Downstream (0-shot)\n496\t    rows:\n497\t    - task: ARC-C\n498\t      bf16: 0.529\n499\t      uniform_4bit: 0.481\n500\t      mckp: 0.514\n501\t      delta_pp: '+3.16'\n502\t    - task: HellaSwag\n503\t      bf16: 0.783\n504\t      uniform_4bit: 0.728\n505\t      mckp: 0.768\n506\t      delta_pp: '+4.00'\n507\t    - task: PIQA\n508\t      bf16: 0.793\n509\t      uniform_4bit: 0.766\n510\t      mckp: 0.779\n511\t      delta_pp: '+1.25'\n512\t    - task: WinoGrande\n513\t      bf16: 0.69\n514\t      uniform_4bit: 0.662\n515\t      mckp: 0.682\n516\t      delta_pp: '+1.97'\n517\t  figures_description:\n518\t  - 'Bar chart: BF16 / Uniform / MCKP per task, with recovery % annotation'\n519\t  analysis: 'Downstream eval 是 reviewer 必问项 (Q7)。Qwen 的 consistent gains across 4\n520\t    tasks 验证 PPL→downstream 转化。 HellaSwag +4.00pp 是 headline downstream 数字。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t- name: Qwen2.5-72B profiling (scale test)\n524\t  plan_id: plan_013\n525\t  description: '在 72B 上运行 profiling-only。分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size scale。\n526\t\n527\t    '\n528\t  expected_results:\n529\t    status: killed (GPU memory)\n530\t    partial_result: L0 sensitivity pattern visible in partial profiling\n531\t    paper_treatment: mentioned as future work\n532\t  result_rationale: '72B profiling 在现有 GPU 资源下被 killed (OOM)。best 档下 reviewer 接受这是\n533\t    resource limitation， 不是 methodological flaw。7B/9B/14B 的 cross-scale evidence (Qwen-7B,\n534\t    Qwen-14B) 已经 demonstrate sensitivity pattern scales。72B 是 \"nice to have\"，论文中列为\n535\t    future work。 reviewer 可能作为 minor revision 要求之一，但不影响 acceptance。\n536\t\n537\t    '\n538\t  tables: []\n539\t  figures_description: []\n540\t  analysis: 72B 是 0-1 个 major objection 的 potential source。best 档下以 future work 处理。\n541\t- name: K/V separation\n542\t  plan_id: plan_014\n543\t  description: 'K 和 V heads 作为独立 MCKP items。测试 K/V asymmetric budget 是否优于 joint K=V。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t  expected_results:\n547\t    kv_sep_ppl: 11.22\n548\t    joint_kv_ppl: 10.91\n549\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n550\t    delta_sep_vs_joint: 0.3\n551\t    sep_k_2bit_count: 16\n552\t    sep_v_uniform_4bit: true\n553\t    kv_asymmetric_heads: 21\n554\t  result_rationale: 'K/V separation 在 Qwen 上略差 (+0.30 PPL)。原因：K heads 的 sensitivity\n555\t    分布与 V heads 不同—— V heads 更 uniform (solver 将 V 全部留 4-bit)，K heads 有更多 heterogeneity\n556\t    (16 个 2-bit vs joint 的 8 个)。 分离后 K side 过度分配 2-bit (少了 V heads 的 budget 共享 buffering)。best\n557\t    档下 reviewer 认可 negative result：K/V joint optimization 更好，framework 自然 handles\n558\t    K/V without asymmetric treatment。 这回答了 reviewer Q6 (\"RateQuant does K/V asymmetric\n559\t    allocation, do you?\")。\n560\t\n561\t    '\n562\t  tables:\n563\t  - name: K/V Separation Ablation\n564\t    rows:\n565\t    - method: Joint K+V MCKP\n566\t      ppl: 10.91\n567\t      k_2bit: 8\n568\t      v_2bit: 0\n569\t    - method: Separate K/V MCKP\n570\t      ppl: 11.22\n571\t      k_2bit: 16\n572\t      v_2bit: 0\n573\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n574\t      ppl: 15.45\n575\t      k_2bit: 0\n576\t      v_2bit: 0\n577\t  figures_description: []\n578\t  analysis: 'Negative result 但有 insight value：V heads 对 quantization 更 robust，K heads\n579\t    更 sensitive。 Joint optimization 通过 budget sharing 自动 discovers 这一点。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t- name: L0-only heuristic baseline\n583\t  plan_id: plan_015\n584\t  description: '最简单的 non-uniform 策略：L0 全部 8-bit，其余 4-bit。以及 L0-constrained random\n585\t    和 naive positional。 测试 MCKP 是否优于 trivial heuristics。\n586\t\n587\t    '\n588\t  expected_results:\n589\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 10.91\n590\t    l0_random_mean: 11.69\n591\t    l0_random_std: 0.42\n592\t    l0_random_median: 11.52\n593\t    naive_positional_ppl: 12.23\n594\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n595\t    mckp_vs_l0_random_median_gap: -5.2%\n596\t    qwen_mckp_beats_all_heuristics: true\n597\t    llama_mckp_ppl: 8.45\n598\t    llama_l0_random_median: 10.04\n599\t    llama_mckp_vs_l0_gap: -15.8%\n600\t    mistral_mckp_ppl: 7.16\n601\t    mistral_l0_random_median: 7.59\n602\t    mistral_mckp_vs_l0_gap: -5.7%\n603\t  result_rationale: 'L0-random (随机选 k 个非 L0 heads 放 2-bit) 在 Qwen 上 median 11.52 vs\n604\t    MCKP 10.91。 MCKP 的 profiling-based 选择 consistently beats random by 5-16%。naive\n605\t    positional (按 layer 顺序) 更差 (12.23)。关键 insight：L0 sensitivity 是 necessary but not\n606\t    sufficient——MCKP 还需要正确选择 which non-L0 heads 放 2-bit。Llama 上 gap 更大 (15.8%) 因为只有\n607\t    2 个 optimal 2-bit heads， random selection 容易选到 sensitive heads。best 档下 reviewer\n608\t    接受 MCKP 优于 all tested heuristics， profiling 有 genuine value (在 benefit 存在的架构上)。\n609\t\n610\t    '\n611\t  tables:\n612\t  - name: Allocation Baseline Comparison (3 models)\n613\t    rows:\n614\t    - model: Qwen\n615\t      mckp: 10.91\n616\t      l0_random_median: 11.52\n617\t      naive: 12.23\n618\t      uniform: 15.45\n619\t    - model: Llama\n620\t      mckp: 8.45\n621\t      l0_random_median: 10.04\n622\t      naive: 9.94\n623\t      uniform: 8.47\n624\t    - model: Mistral\n625\t      mckp: 7.16\n626\t      l0_random_median: 7.59\n627\t      naive: 7.48\n628\t      uniform: 7.13\n629\t  figures_description:\n630\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: MCKP / L0-random / Naive / Uniform across 3 models'\n631\t  analysis: 'MCKP consistently outperforms all heuristics on all 3 models。但 Llama\n632\t    和 Mistral 上 MCKP 仍不如 uniform， reinforcing Claim 3：profiling 只在 spread 型上有 net\n633\t    value。\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t- name: Greedy + cardinality constraint ablation (solver equivalence)\n637\t  plan_id: plan_016\n638\t  description: 'RateQuant greedy + max_2bit=8 vs MCKP + max_2bit=8。验证 constraint 是\n639\t    primary intervention， solver choice 无关。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t  expected_results:\n643\t    greedy_constrained_ppl: 11.2312\n644\t    mckp_constrained_ppl: 11.2312\n645\t    delta: 0.0\n646\t    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n647\t    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n648\t    bit_distribution_both:\n649\t      2: 8\n650\t      4: 100\n651\t      8: 4\n652\t    allocation_identical: true\n653\t  result_rationale: '这是论文最重要的 ablation。Δ=0.0000 意味着 constrained greedy 和 constrained\n654\t    MCKP 产生 IDENTICAL bit allocation。原因：cardinality constraint (k=8) 将 feasible set\n655\t    缩小到 C(100,8)×C(8,4) 个可行解，在这个 reduced space 里 greedy 的 marginal gain ordering 与\n656\t    MCKP 的 global optimal 收敛。unconstrained 下两者都 fail（但 mode 不同：greedy 32.45 vs MCKP\n657\t    36.92）， constrained 下都 succeed 且完全一致。best 档下 reviewer 认可这是 \"constraint is THE\n658\t    contribution\" 的最 powerful evidence——practitioners 不需要实现 MCKP，只需给现有 greedy 加一个参数。\n659\t    A3 假设 (solver equivalence proves constraint is core) 完全成立。\n660\t\n661\t    '\n662\t  tables:\n663\t  - name: Solver Equivalence (Qwen, k=8)\n664\t    rows:\n665\t    - solver: Greedy unconstrained\n666\t      ppl: 32.45\n667\t      2bit_heads: 68\n668\t    - solver: MCKP unconstrained\n669\t      ppl: 36.92\n670\t      2bit_heads: ~70\n671\t    - solver: Greedy + max_2bit=8\n672\t      ppl: 11.2312\n673\t      2bit_heads: 8\n674\t    - solver: MCKP + max_2bit=8\n675\t      ppl: 11.2312\n676\t      2bit_heads: 8\n677\t    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n678\t      ppl: 15.45\n679\t      2bit_heads: 0\n680\t  figures_description:\n681\t  - '2×2 matrix: {unconstrained, constrained} × {greedy, MCKP} — the key figure showing\n682\t    constraint is what matters'\n683\t  analysis: 'Solver equivalence table 是 Claim 2 的 crown jewel。建议作为 Table 1 or prominently\n684\t    in §4。 Reviewer 在 best 档下将 Δ=0.0000 视为 compelling evidence that \"the cardinality\n685\t    constraint, not the solver, is the core contribution.\" 同时在 Qwen-14B 上 greedy=MCKP\n686\t    (Δ=0.0000) 复现。\n687\t\n688\t    '\n689\t- name: Multi-seed error bars\n690\t  plan_id: plan_017\n691\t  description: '3 个不同 calibration seeds 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit on Qwen2.5-7B。\n692\t    报告 mean±std。\n693\t\n694\t    '\n695\t  expected_results:\n696\t    mckp_mean: 10.99\n697\t    mckp_std: 0.065\n698\t    mckp_seeds:\n699\t    - 11.02\n700\t    - 10.9\n701\t    - 11.05\n702\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n703\t    bit_dist_all_seeds: 2:8, 4:100, 8:4\n704\t    allocation_agreement_3way: 0.902\n705\t    pairwise_agreement_range:\n706\t    - 0.911\n707\t    - 0.946\n708\t  result_rationale: 'std=0.065 在 mean=10.99 上是 0.59% CV——非常稳定。所有 3 seeds 产生 identical\n709\t    macro allocation (2:8, 4:100, 8:4)，90.2% heads 在 3 seeds 间完全一致。不一致的 ~10% heads\n710\t    是 sensitivity 接近的 mid-range heads (borderline 2-bit vs 4-bit)，对 PPL 影响 <0.1。uniform\n711\t    是 deterministic (15.45)， MCKP mean 10.99 与 hires single-run 10.91 差 0.08——来自 calibration\n712\t    data sampling variance。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 error bar 证明 robustness，不要求更多 seeds。\n713\t    \"MCKP 10.99±0.065 vs Uniform 15.45\" 的 confidence interval 完全不重叠。\n714\t\n715\t    '\n716\t  tables:\n717\t  - name: Multi-Seed Results (Qwen, 4×)\n718\t    rows:\n719\t    - seed: 0\n720\t      mckp_ppl: 11.02\n721\t      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n722\t    - seed: 1\n723\t      mckp_ppl: 10.9\n724\t      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n725\t    - seed: 2\n726\t      mckp_ppl: 11.05\n727\t      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n728\t    - summary: Mean±Std\n729\t      mckp_ppl: 10.99±0.065\n730\t      bit_dist: identical\n731\t    - reference: Uniform 4-bit\n732\t      ppl: 15.45\n733\t      bit_dist: all 4-bit\n734\t  figures_description:\n735\t  - 'Error bar plot: MCKP (3 seeds) vs Uniform, with CI bands'\n736\t  analysis: 'Error bars 是 reviewer 必问项。std=0.065 证明 single-run results 是 representative。\n737\t    macro allocation 在 seeds 间 stable。remaining variance 来自 borderline heads 的 ordering。\n738\t\n739\t    '\n740\t- name: Runtime/latency benchmark\n741\t  plan_id: plan_018\n742\t  description: '端到端 inference latency 和 throughput：mixed-precision KV cache vs uniform\n743\t    4-bit vs BF16。\n744\t\n745\t    '\n746\t  expected_results:\n747\t    bf16_decode_ms: 33.78\n748\t    uniform_4bit_decode_ms: 42.46\n749\t    mckp_decode_ms: 46.09\n750\t    mckp_solver_sec: 0.005\n751\t    bf16_throughput: 29.6\n752\t    uniform_4bit_throughput: 23.6\n753\t    mckp_throughput: 21.8\n754\t    theoretical_memory_4x_compression: true\n755\t    mckp_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 8.5%\n756\t  result_rationale: 'mixed-precision KV cache 比 uniform 4-bit 慢 8.5% (46.09 vs 42.46\n757\t    ms/tok)。原因： per-head 不同 bit-width 需要 dynamic dequantization dispatch，而 uniform\n758\t    可以 batch all heads 同一 kernel。MCKP solver 本身只需 0.005 sec (negligible)。memory 完全相同\n759\t    (5.25 MB, 4× compression)。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 8.5% latency overhead 作为 reasonable\n760\t    trade-off——PPL 从 15.45 降到 10.91 (29% improvement) 的代价是 8.5% latency。论文应该诚实报告 latency\n761\t    overhead 而非隐藏。 reviewer 可能作为 minor revision 要求 longer-sequence latency 数据（长序列下\n762\t    KV cache decode 是 bottleneck，overhead 比例可能变化）。\n763\t\n764\t    '\n765\t  tables:\n766\t  - name: Runtime Benchmark (Qwen, seq_len=2048)\n767\t    rows:\n768\t    - method: BF16\n769\t      prefill_ms: 45.86\n770\t      decode_ms: 33.78\n771\t      throughput: 29.6\n772\t      memory_MB: 21\n773\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n774\t      prefill_ms: 54.25\n775\t      decode_ms: 42.46\n776\t      throughput: 23.6\n777\t      memory_MB: 5.25\n778\t    - method: Constrained MCKP\n779\t      prefill_ms: 57.03\n780\t      decode_ms: 46.09\n781\t      throughput: 21.8\n782\t      memory_MB: 5.25\n783\t  figures_description:\n784\t  - Latency breakdown bar chart with memory footprint overlay\n785\t  analysis: 'Runtime benchmark 回答 systems reviewer concern。8.5% overhead 是 honest\n786\t    cost。 但 long-context scenario (8K tokens) 是 deployment motivation：uniform 4-bit\n787\t    at 8K degrades 11.15× while MCKP stays at 1.23× — the quality gap more than justifies\n788\t    the latency cost. MCKP solver overhead (5ms) 是 one-time cost, amortized over entire\n789\t    inference session.\n790\t\n791\t    '\n792\t- name: Gemma-2-9B full pipeline\n793\t  plan_id: gemma2_9b_full_pipeline\n794\t  description: 'Gemma-2-9B (GQA 2:1, 336 KV heads) 完整 pipeline。最低 GQA ratio 的 anchor\n795\t    point。\n796\t\n797\t    '\n798\t  expected_results:\n799\t    baseline_ppl: 6.03\n800\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 6.17\n801\t    constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.2\n802\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.47\n803\t    concentration: 0.23\n804\t    distribution_shape: Flat\n805\t    n_2bit_unconstrained: 106\n806\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma-2 是 flat 型 (concentration=0.23, CV=1.28)。solver 无法区分 heads，unconstrained\n807\t    将 106/336=31.5% heads 分到 2-bit。每个 head 的 per-head delta 很小但累积效应产生 1.47× degradation——\n808\t    这是 \"moderate\" tier，不是 catastrophic 也不是 mild。best 档下 reviewer 要求 paper 讨论 three-tier\n809\t    labeling (catastrophic 3.31× / moderate 1.47× / mild 1.07-1.08×)，这 strengthens\n810\t    \"constraint 对所有架构都有价值\" 的 claim。constrained MCKP 将 2-bit 从 106 减到 8，PPL 6.20 vs\n811\t    uniform 6.17—— delta 在噪声范围，确认 flat 型不需要 non-uniform。\n812\t\n813\t    '\n814\t  tables:\n815\t  - name: Gemma-2-9B Results\n816\t    rows:\n817\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n818\t      ppl: 6.03\n819\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n820\t      ppl: 6.17\n821\t    - method: MCKP constrained (k=8)\n822\t      ppl: 6.2\n823\t    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n824\t      ppl: 8.85\n825\t      note: 1.47× baseline\n826\t  figures_description: []\n827\t  analysis: 'Gemma-2 的 1.47× moderate degradation 是论文需要主动讨论的 point。 它证明 constraint\n828\t    即使在 flat 型上也有 value (106→8 2-bit heads)，strengthens universality claim。\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t- name: Yi-1.5-9B full pipeline\n832\t  plan_id: yi15_9b_full_pipeline\n833\t  description: 'Yi-1.5-9B (GQA 8:1, 192 KV heads) 完整 pipeline。最高 GQA ratio 的 counterexample。\n834\t\n835\t    '\n836\t  expected_results:\n837\t    baseline_ppl: 7.02\n838\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.22\n839\t    hires_mckp_ppl: 7.22\n840\t    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n841\t    concentration: 0.71\n842\t    distribution_shape: Spike\n843\t    t1_t5: 0.9\n844\t    l4h3_dominance: single outlier, 64% of total delta\n845\t  result_rationale: 'Yi-1.5 是 spike 型 (L4H3 single extreme outlier, concentration\n846\t    0.71 但 t₁/t₅=0.90)。 GQA 8:1 是所有测试模型中最高，但 benefit = 0%。原因：single outlier 不 create\n847\t    optimization opportunity—— solver 给 L4H3 升 8-bit 后，剩余 heads 全部 near-identical\n848\t    sensitivity，无法区分。 这 disproves \"higher GQA = more benefit\" naive hypothesis。best\n849\t    档下 reviewer 认可 Yi-1.5 是 diagnostic 的 critical validation：concentration 0.71 >\n850\t    0.50 threshold，但 t₁/t₅=0.90 > 0.70—— joint diagnostic 正确预测 \"no benefit\"。单用 concentration\n851\t    会误判。\n852\t\n853\t    '\n854\t  tables:\n855\t  - name: Yi-1.5-9B Results\n856\t    rows:\n857\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n858\t      ppl: 7.02\n859\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n860\t      ppl: 7.22\n861\t    - method: MCKP constrained (k=2)\n862\t      ppl: 7.22\n863\t    - method: Diagnostic prediction\n864\t      result: No benefit (conc=0.71 BUT t₁/t₅=0.90 > 0.70)\n865\t  figures_description:\n866\t  - 'Scatter: Yi-1.5 vs Qwen in (concentration, t₁/t₅) space — both high concentration\n867\t    but different t₁/t₅'\n868\t  analysis: 'Yi-1.5 是 Claim 3 的 strongest supporting evidence。GQA 最高但 benefit 最低——\n869\t    joint diagnostic 的 necessity 因此建立。\n870\t\n871\t    '\n872\t- name: Cross-architecture compounding sweeps\n873\t  plan_id: llama_compounding_sweep + mistral_compounding_sweep_v2 + qwen_compounding_sweep_v2\n874\t  description: 'Llama, Mistral, Qwen 各自的 compounding sweep (PPL vs k)。三个 regime 对比。\n875\t\n876\t    '\n877\t  expected_results:\n878\t    qwen_curve: U-shaped, optimal k=8, catastrophic k>32\n879\t    llama_curve: Monotonic but gentle, k=0 optimal at 4×, catastrophic k>128\n880\t    mistral_curve: Monotonic, k=0 optimal, catastrophic k>128\n881\t    qwen_k8_degradation_pct: 2.4\n882\t    llama_k8_degradation_pct: 1.7\n883\t    mistral_k8_degradation_pct: 0.4\n884\t    universally_safe_k: 8\n885\t  result_rationale: '三种 curve 形状反映三种 sensitivity distribution： - Qwen (spread): k=8\n886\t    释放 budget 给 L0 cluster → PPL 下降；k>8 compounding → PPL 上升 = U-shape - Llama (spike):\n887\t    每增加一个 2-bit head 都轻微增加 PPL，但 sensitivity 分散所以增速慢 - Mistral (flat): 与 Llama 类似但更\n888\t    flat，所有 head 贡献相似 compounding 关键：k≤8 在所有三种 regime 下 degradation < 2.5%，证明 k=8\n889\t    是 universally safe threshold。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 3-architecture sweep 作为 constraint\n890\t    parameterization 的实证基础。\n891\t\n892\t    '\n893\t  tables:\n894\t  - name: Compounding Sweep Summary (k=8)\n895\t    rows:\n896\t    - model: Qwen\n897\t      k8_ppl: 10.05\n898\t      baseline: 9.81\n899\t      degradation_pct: 2.4\n900\t      curve: U-shaped\n901\t    - model: Llama\n902\t      k8_ppl: 8.23\n903\t      baseline: 8.09\n904\t      degradation_pct: 1.7\n905\t      curve: Monotonic gentle\n906\t    - model: Mistral\n907\t      k8_ppl: 7.06\n908\t      baseline: 7.04\n909\t      degradation_pct: 0.4\n910\t      curve: Monotonic flat\n911\t  figures_description:\n912\t  - 'Three-panel compounding curve: Qwen / Llama / Mistral, with k=8 safe zone shaded'\n913\t  analysis: 'Cross-architecture compounding sweep 是 universality claim 的 quantitative\n914\t    backbone。 三种 curve 形状 + 一个 universally safe k = principled parameterization。\n915\t\n916\t    '\n917\t- name: 8K long-context evaluation\n918\t  plan_id: qwen7b_8k_context_eval\n919\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 在 8K token context 下的 PPL 评估。Long-context amplification\n920\t    effect。\n921\t\n922\t    '\n923\t  expected_results:\n924\t    ppl_bf16_8k: 6.97\n925\t    ppl_mckp_8k: 8.59\n926\t    ppl_uniform_4bit_8k: 77.75\n927\t    mckp_degradation_ratio_8k: 1.23\n928\t    uniform_degradation_ratio_8k: 11.15\n929\t    degradation_gap: 9×\n930\t    ppl_bf16_2k: 9.81\n931\t    ppl_mckp_2k: 10.91\n932\t    ppl_uniform_4bit_2k: 15.45\n933\t  result_rationale: 'Long context 放大 2-bit compounding：uniform 4-bit 在 8K 下 PPL 77.75\n934\t    (11.15× baseline)。 原因：每个 decode step 的 attention 覆盖更多 KV cache entries，2-bit quantization\n935\t    error 在 longer attention span 上累积更多。constrained MCKP 通过保护 sensitive heads 在 higher\n936\t    bit-width， 仅 1.23× degradation。9× gap in degradation rate 是 deployment motivation\n937\t    的 headline 数字。 best 档下 reviewer 认可 long-context 结果作为 practical impact evidence——real\n938\t    deployment 通常 operates at 4K-32K context，uniform 4-bit 在此范围内 unacceptable。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t  tables:\n942\t  - name: Long Context PPL (Qwen, 4×)\n943\t    rows:\n944\t    - context: 2K\n945\t      bf16: 9.81\n946\t      mckp: 10.91\n947\t      uniform: 15.45\n948\t      mckp_ratio: 1.11×\n949\t      uniform_ratio: 1.57×\n950\t    - context: 8K\n951\t      bf16: 6.97\n952\t      mckp: 8.59\n953\t      uniform: 77.75\n954\t      mckp_ratio: 1.23×\n955\t      uniform_ratio: 11.15×\n956\t  figures_description:\n957\t  - 'PPL vs context length: MCKP stays flat while uniform 4-bit explodes — the deployment\n958\t    motivation figure'\n959\t  analysis: 'Long-context result 是 paper 的 deployment hook。\"11.15× vs 1.23×\" 在 abstract\n960\t    中出现。 Reviewer 在 best 档下将此视为 constraint 的 practical value 的 strongest evidence。\n961\t\n962\t    '\n963\t- name: Qwen-14B constrained pipeline + solver equivalence\n964\t  plan_id: qwen14b_constrained_pipeline + qwen14b_greedy_constrained\n965\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-14B (384 KV heads) 验证 scale generalization 和 solver equivalence。\n966\t\n967\t    '\n968\t  expected_results:\n969\t    baseline_ppl: 6.87\n970\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.2\n971\t    constrained_mckp_ppl: 7.22\n972\t    unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 7.69\n973\t    greedy_constrained_ppl: 7.22\n974\t    delta_greedy_vs_mckp: 0.0\n975\t    concentration: 0.33\n976\t    shape: Flat\n977\t    unconstrained_over_uniform: true\n978\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B (384 heads, flat 型 concentration=0.33) 展示两点： (1) unconstrained\n979\t    still fails (7.69 > 7.20 uniform)，即使在 14B scale (2) solver equivalence 完美复现 (greedy\n980\t    constrained = MCKP constrained, Δ=0.0000) 14B 是 flat 型所以 non-uniform benefit ≈\n981\t    0%，与 Claim 3 一致。 best 档下 reviewer 认可 14B 作为 scale validation + solver equivalence\n982\t    的 second data point。\n983\t\n984\t    '\n985\t  tables:\n986\t  - name: Qwen-14B Results\n987\t    rows:\n988\t    - method: BF16\n989\t      ppl: 6.87\n990\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n991\t      ppl: 7.2\n992\t    - method: MCKP constrained\n993\t      ppl: 7.22\n994\t    - method: Greedy constrained\n995\t      ppl: 7.22\n996\t      note: Δ=0.0000 vs MCKP\n997\t    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n998\t      ppl: 7.69\n999\t  figures_description: []\n1000\t  analysis: 'Solver equivalence 在 14B 上完美复现，strengthens \"constraint makes solver irrelevant\"\n1001\t    universality。\n1002\t\n1003\t    '\n1004\t- name: Pythia-1.4B constrained pipeline\n1005\t  plan_id: pythia14b_constrained_pipeline\n1006\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B (MHA, 384 KV heads) 在非 GQA 架构上验证。\n1007\t\n1008\t    '\n1009\t  expected_results:\n1010\t    baseline_ppl: 16.49\n1011\t    uniform_4bit_ppl: 24.29\n1012\t    constrained_mckp_ppl: 24.45\n1013\t    unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 31.54\n1014\t    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: -0.16\n1015\t    concentration: 0.24\n1016\t    shape: Flat\n1017\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia 是 MHA (non-GQA) 架构，384 KV heads，flat 型 (concentration=0.24)。\n1018\t    unconstrained 显著 fail (31.54 vs 24.29 uniform, 1.30×)。constrained 与 uniform 几乎持平。\n1019\t    best 档下 reviewer 认可：(1) compounding 不仅影响 GQA 架构，MHA 同样受害，strengthens universality；\n1020\t    (2) flat 型 non-uniform 无价值，consistent with diagnostic prediction。\n1021\t\n1022\t    '\n1023\t  tables:\n1024\t  - name: Pythia-1.4B Results\n1025\t    rows:\n1026\t    - method: BF16\n1027\t      ppl: 16.49\n1028\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n1029\t      ppl: 24.29\n1030\t    - method: MCKP constrained\n1031\t      ppl: 24.45\n1032\t    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n1033\t      ppl: 31.54\n1034\t  figures_description: []\n1035\t  analysis: 'Pythia 扩展 architecture coverage 到 MHA (GQA ratio 1:1)。8/8 unconstrained\n1036\t    degradation confirmed。\n1037\t\n1038\t    '\n1039\t- name: Phi-3-medium hires profiling\n1040\t  plan_id: phi3_medium_hires_profiling_v2\n1041\t  description: 'Phi-3-medium (400 KV heads) profiling。第 8 个架构，完成 8/8 universality。\n1042\t\n1043\t    '\n1044\t  expected_results:\n1045\t    concentration: 0.17\n1046\t    t1_t5: 0.24\n1047\t    shape: Spread (low concentration)\n1048\t    cv: 0.89\n1049\t    top1_head: L9H6\n1050\t    total_heads: 400\n1051\t  result_rationale: 'Phi-3-medium concentration=0.17 (lowest in our test set)，但 t₁/t₅=0.24\n1052\t    suggests sensitivity spread across multiple mid-layer heads (L8-L11 cluster)。低\n1053\t    concentration + low t₁/t₅ 是 \"diffuse spread\" pattern——sensitivity exists but not\n1054\t    concentrated enough for MCKP to exploit at 4×。 best 档下这补全了第 8 个架构的 profiling data，支持\n1055\t    8/8 unconstrained degradation universality claim。 full constrained pipeline 未完成（资源限制），但\n1056\t    profiling pattern is sufficient for diagnostic validation。\n1057\t\n1058\t    '\n1059\t  tables:\n1060\t  - name: Phi-3-medium Profiling Summary\n1061\t    rows:\n1062\t    - metric: Top-5% concentration\n1063\t      value: 0.17\n1064\t    - metric: t₁/t₅\n1065\t      value: 0.24\n1066\t    - metric: Distribution shape\n1067\t      value: Diffuse spread\n1068\t    - metric: Diagnostic prediction\n1069\t      value: No benefit at 4× (conc < 0.50)\n1070\t  figures_description: []\n1071\t  analysis: 'Phi-3-medium 是 diagnostic 的 edge case：concentration 低但 t₁/t₅ 也低。 Joint\n1072\t    diagnostic 预测 no benefit (concentration < 0.50)。9/9 accuracy 如果 full pipeline\n1073\t    确认。\n1074\t\n1075\t    '\n1076\t- name: CodeLlama-7B profiling\n1077\t  plan_id: codellama_hires_profiling\n1078\t  description: 'CodeLlama-7B (MHA, 1024 KV heads) profiling。Spike pattern validation。\n1079\t\n1080\t    '\n1081\t  expected_results:\n1082\t    concentration: 0.8\n1083\t    t1_t5: 0.81\n1084\t    shape: Spike\n1085\t    top1_head: L1H1 (delta=23.0)\n1086\t    total_heads: 1024\n1087\t    diagnostic_prediction: No benefit (t₁/t₅=0.81 > 0.70)\n1088\t  result_rationale: 'CodeLlama 是 extreme spike：L1H1 delta=23.0，next head 仅 2.04。concentration\n1089\t    0.80 (highest tested) 但 t₁/t₅=0.81——single dominant outlier。与 Yi-1.5 (0.71/0.90)\n1090\t    类似的 spike pattern。 Joint diagnostic 正确预测 no benefit (t₁/t₅ > 0.70)。best 档下 reviewer\n1091\t    认可 CodeLlama 作为 concentration alone 不够的 second example (alongside Yi-1.5)，justifying\n1092\t    joint diagnostic。\n1093\t\n1094\t    '\n1095\t  tables:\n1096\t  - name: CodeLlama-7B Profiling\n1097\t    rows:\n1098\t    - metric: Concentration\n1099\t      value: 0.8\n1100\t    - metric: t₁/t₅\n1101\t      value: 0.81\n1102\t    - metric: Shape\n1103\t      value: Spike (L1H1 dominant)\n1104\t    - metric: Diagnostic\n1105\t      value: No benefit (conc>0.50 BUT t₁/t₅>0.70)\n1106\t  figures_description: []\n1107\t  analysis: 'CodeLlama 与 Yi-1.5 形成 spike-pattern pair。两者都有 high concentration 但 high\n1108\t    t₁/t₅—— single outlier cannot be exploited by MCKP。9/9 diagnostic accuracy (9th\n1109\t    model)。\n1110\t\n1111\t    '\n1112\t- name: KIVI baseline comparison\n1113\t  plan_id: kivi_baseline_qwen_llama + kivi_baseline_qwen7b_v2\n1114\t  description: 'KIVI (per-channel group quantization) 作为 orthogonal baseline。验证 per-head\n1115\t    方法的 positioning。\n1116\t\n1117\t    '\n1118\t  expected_results:\n1119\t    qwen_kivi_4bit_g32_r128: 9.9\n1120\t    qwen_kivi_4bit_g32_r0: 9.91\n1121\t    qwen_mckp_constrained: 10.91\n1122\t    qwen_uniform_4bit: 15.45\n1123\t    llama_kivi_4bit_r128: 8.14\n1124\t    llama_uniform_4bit: 8.47\n1125\t  result_rationale: 'KIVI 4-bit (g32, r128) 在 Qwen 上 PPL 9.90——比我们的 constrained MCKP\n1126\t    10.91 更好。 但两者是 orthogonal 且 complementary：KIVI 优化 per-channel group quantization\n1127\t    granularity， 我们优化 per-head bit-width allocation。best 档下 reviewer 理解 positioning：\n1128\t    (1) 我们的 contribution 是 compounding failure mode 的 discovery + constraint fix，不是\n1129\t    beat KIVI (2) KIVI + 我们的 constraint 可以 combine (per-head allocation + per-channel\n1130\t    group quantization) (3) KIVI 的 group quantization 减轻了 per-value quantization error，所以在\n1131\t    uniform bit-width 下更好 Paper 应清晰 position as complementary，不 compete on PPL numbers。\n1132\t\n1133\t    '\n1134\t  tables:\n1135\t  - name: KIVI Comparison (Qwen, 4×)\n1136\t    rows:\n1137\t    - method: KIVI 4-bit (g32, r128)\n1138\t      ppl: 9.9\n1139\t      approach: per-channel\n1140\t    - method: Constrained MCKP\n1141\t      ppl: 10.91\n1142\t      approach: per-head\n1143\t    - method: Uniform 4-bit (ours)\n1144\t      ppl: 15.45\n1145\t      approach: per-head\n1146\t    - method: BF16 baseline\n1147\t      ppl: 9.81\n1148\t      approach: —\n1149\t  figures_description: []\n1150\t  analysis: 'KIVI 是 orthogonal method。论文 position：KIVI 优化 within-bit quantization\n1151\t    quality， 我们优化 cross-bit allocation + discover failure mode。两者 combine for further\n1152\t    improvement。\n1153\t\n1154\t    '\n1155\t- name: Cross-architecture downstream eval (Yi, Llama, Mistral, Gemma-2)\n1156\t  plan_id: w3_downstream_eval + gemma2_downstream_k8_4task_v2\n1157\t  description: '5 个模型的完整 downstream eval (5 tasks, 0-shot)。验证 PPL→downstream consistency。\n1158\t\n1159\t    '\n1160\t  expected_results:\n1161\t    qwen_avg_delta_vs_uniform: +1.92pp\n1162\t    yi_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.77pp\n1163\t    llama_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.99pp\n1164\t    mistral_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.48pp\n1165\t    gemma2_avg_delta_vs_uniform: +0.14pp (noise)\n1166\t    downstream_consistency_with_ppl: 5/5\n1167\t    arc_challenge_systematic_degradation: true\n1168\t  result_rationale: 'Downstream results 完美 mirror PPL patterns：Qwen (spread) 是唯一 consistent\n1169\t    gainer (+1.25 to +4.00pp)。 4 个 non-spread 模型显示 minor systematic degradation (Yi\n1170\t    -0.77, Llama -0.99, Mistral -0.48) 或 noise (Gemma-2 +0.14)。arc_challenge 是 worst-case\n1171\t    task (Yi -3.24pp, Llama -2.65pp)—— multi-step reasoning 对 KV cache error 最敏感。best\n1172\t    档下 reviewer 要求 paper 诚实报告 per-task tables 并讨论 arc_challenge 系统性信号，但接受 diagnostic\n1173\t    正确预测 downstream outcomes (5/5) 作为 Claim 3 的 strong validation。\n1174\t\n1175\t    '\n1176\t  tables:\n1177\t  - name: Downstream Summary (5 models, 0-shot avg)\n1178\t    rows:\n1179\t    - model: Qwen (Spread)\n1180\t      delta_pp: '+1.92'\n1181\t      prediction: Benefit\n1182\t      correct: ✓\n1183\t    - model: Yi-1.5 (Spike)\n1184\t      delta_pp: '-0.77'\n1185\t      prediction: No benefit\n1186\t      correct: ✓\n1187\t    - model: Llama (Spike)\n1188\t      delta_pp: '-0.99'\n1189\t      prediction: No benefit\n1190\t      correct: ✓\n1191\t    - model: Mistral (Flat)\n1192\t      delta_pp: '-0.48'\n1193\t      prediction: No benefit\n1194\t      correct: ✓\n1195\t    - model: Gemma-2 (Flat)\n1196\t      delta_pp: '+0.14'\n1197\t      prediction: No benefit\n1198\t      correct: ✓\n1199\t  figures_description:\n1200\t  - 'Per-task heatmap: 5 models × 5 tasks, color-coded by delta vs uniform'\n1201\t  analysis: '5/5 downstream consistency 是 diagnostic 的 ultimate validation。论文必须： (a)\n1202\t    报告完整 per-task tables，(b) 用 \"shows minor degradation\" 不用 \"preserves accuracy\"，\n1203\t    (c) 主动讨论 arc_challenge 作为 worst-case。\n1204\t\n1205\t    '\n1206\t- name: Qwen 3-seed downstream CI\n1207\t  plan_id: qwen_3seed_downstream_ci\n1208\t  description: '3 个 calibration seeds 的 downstream eval，提供 confidence intervals。\n1209\t\n1210\t    '\n1211\t  expected_results:\n1212\t    hellaswag_delta: +4.13pp\n1213\t    hellaswag_std: 0.0022\n1214\t    winogrande_delta: +1.58pp\n1215\t    winogrande_std: 0.0115\n1216\t    piqa_delta: +1.96pp\n1217\t    piqa_std: 0.0023\n1218\t    arc_challenge_delta: 0.00pp\n1219\t    arc_challenge_std: 0.0035\n1220\t    avg_delta: +1.92pp\n1221\t  result_rationale: '3-seed downstream CI 显示 low variance (std 0.002-0.012)。HellaSwag\n1222\t    和 PIQA 的 gain 是 robust (CI 不含 0)。arc_challenge delta=0 with std=0.0035 说明 arc_challenge\n1223\t    上 MCKP 和 uniform 差异 在统计噪声内——但 mean 仍正（与单 seed 的 +3.16pp 不矛盾，因为 3-seed 用了不同 calibration\n1224\t    data）。 WinoGrande std=0.0115 较高，反映 task 的 inherent variance。best 档下 reviewer 接受\n1225\t    3-seed CI 证明 downstream gains 是 robust，不要求更多 seeds。\n1226\t\n1227\t    '\n1228\t  tables:\n1229\t  - name: 3-Seed Downstream CI (Qwen)\n1230\t    rows:\n1231\t    - task: HellaSwag\n1232\t      delta: +4.13pp\n1233\t      std: 0.0022\n1234\t      robust: ✓\n1235\t    - task: PIQA\n1236\t      delta: +1.96pp\n1237\t      std: 0.0023\n1238\t      robust: ✓\n1239\t    - task: WinoGrande\n1240\t      delta: +1.58pp\n1241\t      std: 0.0115\n1242\t      robust: ✓\n1243\t    - task: ARC-C\n1244\t      delta: 0.00pp\n1245\t      std: 0.0035\n1246\t      robust: borderline\n1247\t  figures_description: []\n1248\t  analysis: '3-seed CI 是 statistical credibility 的必要 evidence。HellaSwag/PIQA robust，\n1249\t    ARC-C borderline（可能需要 more seeds 作为 minor revision）。\n1250\t\n1251\t    '\n1252\t- name: W9 compounding scaling (top-k vs random-k)\n1253\t  plan_id: w9_compounding_v2\n1254\t  description: 'Compounding scaling test: top-k (most sensitive) vs random-k heads\n1255\t    at 2-bit。 证明 compounding 是 universal，不依赖 which heads selected。\n1256\t\n1257\t    '\n1258\t  expected_results:\n1259\t    k8_topk_ppl: 10.04\n1260\t    k8_randomk_mean: 11.07\n1261\t    k8_randomk_std: 0.69\n1262\t    k16_topk_ppl: 10.42\n1263\t    k16_randomk_mean: 12.91\n1264\t    k32_topk_ppl: 11.6\n1265\t    k32_randomk_mean: 18.33\n1266\t    k64_topk_ppl: 22.95\n1267\t    k64_randomk_mean: 55.94\n1268\t    compounding_ratio_k64_topk: 4.89\n1269\t    compounding_ratio_k64_randomk: 8.88\n1270\t  result_rationale: 'top-k 选最 sensitive heads 放 2-bit——每个 head 的 per-head impact 最大但\n1271\t    compounding 仍然发生。 random-k compounding 更严重因为随机可能选到 correlated heads（同一 layer 的多个\n1272\t    head 同时 2-bit 导致该 layer 的 representation 整体崩溃）。两者都展示超线性增长：k=8→k=64 的 PPL 增长远超\n1273\t    8× ratio。 best 档下这是 Claim 1 (non-additivity) 的 controlled experiment evidence：\n1274\t    如果 distortion 是 additive，random-k 应该 ≈ sum of individual deltas，但实际 8.88× > linear\n1275\t    prediction。\n1276\t\n1277\t    '\n1278\t  tables:\n1279\t  - name: Top-k vs Random-k Compounding\n1280\t    rows:\n1281\t    - k: 8\n1282\t      topk: 10.04\n1283\t      randomk_mean: 11.07±0.69\n1284\t      ratio_topk: 1.56×\n1285\t      ratio_randomk: 1.76×\n1286\t    - k: 16\n1287\t      topk: 10.42\n1288\t      randomk_mean: 12.91±0.40\n1289\t      ratio_topk: 1.56×\n1290\t      ratio_randomk: 2.10×\n1291\t    - k: 32\n1292\t      topk: 11.6\n1293\t      randomk_mean: 18.33±2.53\n1294\t      ratio_topk: 1.78×\n1295\t      ratio_randomk: 2.73×\n1296\t    - k: 64\n1297\t      topk: 22.95\n1298\t      randomk_mean: 55.94±9.73\n1299\t      ratio_topk: 4.89×\n1300\t      ratio_randomk: 8.88×\n1301\t  figures_description:\n1302\t  - 'Log-scale PPL vs k: top-k vs random-k with variance bands — superlinear growth\n1303\t    = non-additivity evidence'\n1304\t  analysis: Top-k vs random-k 是 non-additivity 的 cleanest experimental evidence。 Random-k\n1305\t    的 higher variance 和 worse mean 说明 head selection matters —— 但即使 top-k (best case)\n1306\t    也展示 compounding。这支持 \"constraint is needed regardless of solver quality\"。\n1307\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7b9a637-3199-45af-a202-1f5fee8b9b34","uuid":"5826b580-9d6e-4af3-bf73-2723ada97e14","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:45:27.092Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T021448/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claim 原样保留。Reviewer 认可 2-bit compounding 作为\n  universal failure mode 的新颖性， cardinality constraint 作为 principled intervention（非\n  trivial heuristic），1/8 benefit 作为对 field 隐含假设的重要修正。 avg_review_score 3.5-4.0，p_accept\n  0.4-0.6，major objections 0-1，narrative rewrite 0-10%。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: L0 exclusion removal\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '移除 solver 中的 L0 硬排除约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8。验证 solver 纯粹从 profiling data\n    自动发现 L0 sensitivity， 将 L0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    solver_auto_assigns_l0_8bit: true\n    ppl_with_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n    ppl_without_l0_exclusion: 10.91\n    delta: 0.0\n    l0_heads_assigned_8bit: 4\n    bit_distribution:\n      2: 8\n      4: 100\n      8: 4\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下，profiling data 的信号足够强：L0 的 4 个 head 的 2-bit delta (合计占总\n    delta 58.6%) 远高于其他 head。 MCKP solver 在 max_2bit=8 约束下，自然将这 4 个 high-delta head\n    升到 8-bit，无需硬编码 L0 排除规则。 这强化了 \"constraint 是 principled，不是 ad-hoc\" 的叙事——solver 自动发现了结构，constraint\n    只防止过度分配。 Reviewer 在 best 档下接受这一点作为 constraint principled-ness 的证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: L0 Exclusion Ablation\n    rows:\n    - condition: With L0 exclusion\n      ppl: 10.91\n      l0_bits: 8-bit (forced)\n      other_2bit: 8\n    - condition: Without L0 exclusion\n      ppl: 10.91\n      l0_bits: 8-bit (auto)\n      other_2bit: 8\n  figures_description:\n  - Bit allocation heatmap showing solver auto-discovers L0 sensitivity pattern identical\n    to forced exclusion\n  analysis: 'PPL delta=0.0 证明 L0 排除是冗余的——profiling quality 足以让 solver 自主发现。 这消除了 \"你的方法依赖\n    L0 domain knowledge\" 的攻击面。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama-3.1-8B full pipeline\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1, 256 KV heads) 上复现完整 pipeline。 测试 cross-architecture\n    generalizability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl_bf16: 8.09\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.47\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 8.45\n    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 8.63\n    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: +0.2%\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.07\n    natural_2bit_count: 2\n    concentration: 0.57\n    distribution_shape: Spike\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 是 spike 型架构（L2H5 single dominant head, t₁/t₅≈0.85）。GQA=4:1\n    + 256 heads 意味着 sensitivity 分散在大量 heads 上，单个 outlier 无法被 MCKP 充分利用。unconstrained\n    solver 仅选 12 heads 到 2-bit (4.7%)，compounding 效应轻微但仍存在 (1.07×)。constrained MCKP\n    与 uniform 几乎持平 (+0.2%)。 best 档下 reviewer 接受这是对 Claim 3 的正面证据：spike 型 + 低 concentration\n    架构不需要 non-uniform， diagnostic 正确预测了这一结果。7/8 negative 是 contribution 的一部分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Llama-3.1-8B Pipeline Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 8.09\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 8.47\n    - method: MCKP constrained (k=2)\n      ppl: 8.45\n    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 8.63\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-head sensitivity heatmap: single dominant L2H5 outlier, rest flat'\n  analysis: 'Llama 代表 \"spike + low benefit\" 的典型案例。constrained MCKP 自然选 k=2（constraint\n    never binds）， 与 uniform 差异在噪声范围内。unconstrained 仍比 uniform 差 (1.07×)，确认 compounding\n    是 universal。\n\n    '\n- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 full pipeline\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline。不同架构族验证 cross-architecture validity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl_bf16: 7.04\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.13\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 7.16\n    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 7.57\n    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: -0.4%\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n    concentration: 0.22\n    distribution_shape: Flat\n    k_ablation_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral 是 flat 型架构（concentration=0.22, CV=1.31）。profiler 报告近零信号差异——heads\n    间 sensitivity 几乎无差别。unconstrained solver 将 42/256=16.4% heads 分到 2-bit，因为无法区分好坏，\n    累积 compounding 产生 1.08× 退化。k ablation 单调递增（每增加一个 2-bit head 都是损失）， 证实 profiler\n    zero-signal = uniform 最优。best 档下 reviewer 认可这是 Claim 3 的关键证据： flat 型架构 profiling\n    是浪费，直接 uniform 即可。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Pipeline Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 7.04\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 7.13\n    - method: MCKP constrained (k=4)\n      ppl: 7.16\n    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 7.57\n  - name: Mistral k Ablation\n    rows:\n    - k: 4\n      ppl: 7.165\n    - k: 8\n      ppl: 7.2\n    - k: 12\n      ppl: 7.245\n    - k: 16\n      ppl: 7.311\n    - k: 18\n      ppl: 7.323\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Monotonically increasing k-PPL curve: zero-signal profiler means every 2-bit\n    allocation hurts'\n  analysis: 'Mistral 的 monotonic k-PPL 曲线与 Qwen 的 U-shaped 形成对比——论文中并列展示，直观说明 spread\n    vs flat 的根本区别。Constrained 比 uniform 略差 0.4%，确认 non-uniform 无价值。\n\n    '\n- name: Compounding effect characterization sweep\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112。绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线， 定位\n    compounding threshold。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ppl_k0: 9.81\n    ppl_k8: 10.05\n    ppl_k16: 10.42\n    ppl_k32: 11.6\n    ppl_k64: 22.95\n    ppl_k112: ~98.8\n    safe_threshold_k: 8\n    degradation_at_k8_pct: 2.4%\n    compounding_onset: k≈16-32\n    curve_shape: U-shaped with sharp elbow at k≈32\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen 是 spread 型 (L0 cluster of 4 heads)。k≤8 时，solver 仅将低-sensitivity\n    heads 分到 2-bit， compounding 可控 (<2.5%)。k=8 是 sweet spot：允许 8 个 2-bit heads 释放\n    budget 给 L0 4 heads 升 8-bit， PPL 显著优于 uniform。k>16 后 compounding 呈超线性增长——2-bit\n    distortion 通过 residual stream 非加性累积，profiling 预测 joint PPL≈11 但实际 32-37 (3× error)。best\n    档下 reviewer 接受这是 compounding 效应的 first quantitative characterization，U-shaped\n    曲线是 headline figure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Qwen Compounding Sweep\n    rows:\n    - k: 0\n      ppl: 9.81\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.0\n    - k: 8\n      ppl: 10.05\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.02\n    - k: 16\n      ppl: 10.42\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.06\n    - k: 32\n      ppl: 11.6\n      ratio_to_baseline: 1.18\n    - k: 64\n      ppl: 22.95\n      ratio_to_baseline: 2.34\n    - k: 112\n      ppl: 98.75\n      ratio_to_baseline: 10.07\n  figures_description:\n  - 'PPL vs max_2bit sweep: U-shaped curve with safe zone (k≤8), transition zone (16-32),\n    catastrophic zone (>48)'\n  - 'Superposition: Qwen U-shaped vs Mistral monotonic vs Llama flat — three regimes\n    in one figure'\n  analysis: 'compounding sweep 是 Claim 1 的核心定量证据。k=8 threshold 在所有架构上 universally\n    safe (<2.5% degradation)， 为 Claim 2 的 constraint parameterization 提供实证基础。\n\n    '\n- name: Budget sweep (2×, 4×, 8×)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 compression ratio 2×, 4×, 8× (budget=0.5,\n    0.25, 0.125)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    budget_0.5:\n      mckp_ppl: ~9.85\n      uniform_ppl: ~10.2\n      delta_pct: +3.4%\n    budget_0.25:\n      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n      delta_pct: +29.4%\n    budget_0.125:\n      mckp_ppl: ~57.6\n      uniform_2bit_ppl: ~2644\n      delta_pct: '>97%'\n  result_rationale: 'Compression 越激进，non-uniform allocation 的价值越大。2× 时 budget 充裕，大部分\n    heads 留在 4-bit， 差异小。4× 是 paper 主战场，MCKP +29.4% 是 headline。8× 时 uniform 只能全 2-bit\n    (PPL 2644 catastrophic)， 而 MCKP 通过 cardinality constraint 保护关键 heads 在 4-bit，PPL\n    57.6——仍然高但 45× better。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 \"compression amplifies benefit\" 作为\n    deployment motivation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Budget Sweep Results\n    rows:\n    - budget: 0.5\n      compression: 2×\n      mckp_ppl: 9.85\n      uniform_ppl: 10.2\n      improvement: +3.4%\n    - budget: 0.25\n      compression: 4×\n      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n      improvement: +29.4%\n    - budget: 0.125\n      compression: 8×\n      mckp_ppl: 57.6\n      uniform_ppl: 2644\n      improvement: '>97%'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Log-scale PPL vs compression ratio: MCKP and uniform diverge exponentially at\n    aggressive compression'\n  analysis: 'Budget sweep 回答 reviewer Q4 (\"How does this work at different compression\n    ratios?\")。 关键 insight: moderate compression 是 practical sweet spot，aggressive\n    compression 展示 constraint 的 catastrophic prevention 价值。\n\n    '\n- name: High-resolution profiling\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '64 seq × 2048 tokens hires profiling (vs 16×512 lowres)。验证 profiling\n    quality 影响 allocation quality。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hires_mckp_ppl: 10.91\n    lowres_mckp_ppl: 11.23\n    improvement_ppl: 0.32\n    improvement_pct: 2.9%\n    hires_nonzero_2bit_heads: 100\n    lowres_nonzero_2bit_heads: 37\n    profiling_time_min: 65.5\n    allocation_diff_count: 8\n    bit_distribution:\n      2: 8\n      4: 100\n      8: 4\n  result_rationale: 'hires profiling 将 non-zero 2-bit delta 的 head 数从 37 增到 100/112，给\n    solver 更多信号区分 heads。 PPL 从 11.23 降到 10.91 (gap recovery 从 ~75% 升到 ~81%)。8 个 head\n    的分配发生变化。 best 档下，reviewer 认可 profiling resolution 是一个 practical hyperparameter，65\n    min 的开销对 offline profiling 可接受。这强化了 \"profiling data quality matters\" 的叙事，但 constraint\n    仍然是 primary intervention——hires 只是 marginal improvement on top of constraint。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Profiling Resolution Comparison\n    rows:\n    - resolution: 16×512 (lowres)\n      mckp_ppl: 11.23\n      nonzero_heads: 37\n      time_min: ~10\n    - resolution: 64×2048 (hires)\n      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n      nonzero_heads: 100\n      time_min: 65.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-head delta heatmap: lowres vs hires, showing hires reveals mid-layer sensitivity\n    structure'\n  analysis: 'hires profiling 是论文 §5.4 的 ablation。关键区别：lowres 下 solver 只能区分 37 heads，\n    hires 下能区分 100 heads。但两者 bit distribution 完全相同 (2:8, 4:100, 8:4)——constraint 的稳定性\n    进一步证明它是 robust intervention。\n\n    '\n- name: C4 cross-dataset evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '在 C4 上 calibrate 和 evaluate，验证结果不依赖 WikiText-2。包含 cross-domain transfer。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_uniform_ppl: 15.45\n    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n    agreement_heads: 108/112\n    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n    cross_domain_wt2_to_c4_uniform_ppl: 35.42\n    contamination_impact: 0.034\n  result_rationale: '96.4% allocation agreement (108/112 heads) 证明 profiling-based\n    allocation 对 calibration data 的 choice 鲁棒。 4 个不一致 heads 的 delta 差异小，对最终 PPL 影响仅\n    0.034。cross-domain transfer (wt2→c4) 同样 MCKP >> uniform (20.56 vs 35.42)。best\n    档下 reviewer 接受 \"calibration-robust\" 的 claim， 不要求额外 calibration domain 实验。WikiText-2\n    contamination 不是 concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Dataset Calibration\n    rows:\n    - calibration: WikiText-2\n      eval: WikiText-2\n      mckp_ppl: 10.91\n      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n    - calibration: C4\n      eval: WikiText-2\n      mckp_ppl: 11.29\n      uniform_ppl: 15.45\n    - calibration: WikiText-2\n      eval: C4\n      mckp_ppl: 20.56\n      uniform_ppl: 35.42\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'C4 实验回答 \"WikiText-2 specific?\" 质疑。96.4% agreement 是 strong evidence。\n    cross-domain transfer 性能比同 domain 差但 MCKP 优势保持。\n\n    '\n- name: RateQuant greedy comparison\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '实现 RateQuant Algorithm 1 greedy 在 {2,4,8,16} 上。证明 polymatroid optimality\n    在非连续 bit-width 上 breaks。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    greedy_2bit_count: 68\n    greedy_bit_dist:\n      2: 68\n      4: 30\n      8: 4\n      16: 10\n  result_rationale: 'RateQuant 的 greedy 依赖 polymatroid structure (Prop. 6)，要求 bit-width\n    是连续整数 {2,...,6}。 在 {2,4,8,16} 上，marginal gain per bit 的 submodularity breaks：2→4\n    的 gain-per-bit 与 4→8 的 gain-per-bit 不再单调，greedy 过度分配 2-bit (68/112 = 60.7%)。PPL\n    32.45 (3.31× baseline)。 甚至 MCKP unconstrained 更差 (36.92)——因为 independent profiling\n    低估了 joint 2-bit distortion。 best 档下 reviewer 接受这是 RateQuant 在 hardware-aligned\n    bit-widths 上的 genuine gap， 我们的 constraint 修复了这个 gap。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RateQuant vs MCKP on {2,4,8,16}\n    rows:\n    - method: RateQuant greedy (unconstrained)\n      ppl: 32.45\n      2bit_heads: 68\n    - method: MCKP (unconstrained)\n      ppl: 36.92\n      2bit_heads: ~70\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      2bit_heads: 0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bit allocation comparison: greedy vs MCKP vs constrained, showing over-allocation\n    of 2-bit'\n  analysis: '核心 differentiation evidence。两个 SOTA solver 都 fail——问题不在 solver algorithm，在\n    compounding。 这消除了 \"换个更好的 solver 就行\" 的反驳。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle comparison\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Brute-force optimal allocation on subset of layers。量化 MCKP 与 oracle\n    的 gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mckp_ppl: 10.91\n    max_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.018\n    avg_oracle_gap_ppl: 0.005\n    layers_mckp_optimal: 5/8\n    layers_with_gap: 3\n    gap_nature: 2-bit head position swap within same bit budget\n    total_evals: 54\n  result_rationale: 'constrained MCKP 在 5/8 layers 上 exactly optimal。3 个 layer 上存在\n    0.005-0.018 PPL 的微小 gap， 来源是 2-bit head 的位置交换（同一 bit budget 内选择不同的 head 放 2-bit）。gap\n    < 0.02 PPL 证明 constrained MCKP 是 near-optimal solver，独立 profiling 的 non-additivity\n    在 k≤8 时可控。 best 档下 reviewer 不会追问 oracle gap——0.018 PPL 在 baseline 9.81 上是 0.18%，可忽略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Oracle Gap by Layer Group\n    rows:\n    - layer_group: L0-L3\n      oracle_gap: 0.0\n    - layer_group: L1\n      oracle_gap: 0.018\n    - layer_group: L4\n      oracle_gap: 0.005\n    - layer_group: L11\n      oracle_gap: 0.014\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Oracle comparison 回答 \"MCKP 是否足够好\"。avg gap 0.005 证明 constrained MCKP +\n    independent profiling 在 k≤8 下是 practically optimal。gap 的 nature (position swap)\n    说明 non-additivity 在小 k 下 影响 limited to head ordering，不影响 bit budget 分配。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-domain calibration robustness\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'calibrate on C4, evaluate on WikiText-2 (and vice versa)。报告 per-head\n    allocation agreement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    allocation_agreement_c4_vs_wt2: 0.964\n    agreement_heads: 108/112\n    c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl: 11.29\n    wt2_cal_c4_eval_mckp_ppl: 20.56\n    contamination_impact: 0.034\n  result_rationale: '同 plan_007。per-head sensitivity 的 ranking 主要由 architecture 决定（哪些\n    head 做 attention over long-range patterns），calibration data 的 domain 只影响 delta\n    的 magnitude 而非 ordering。 96.4% agreement 是 strong cross-domain robustness。best\n    档下 reviewer 满意。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 与 plan_007 合并报告。96.4% agreement 是 appendix 的支撑数据。\n- name: Head sensitivity visualization\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '生成 paper-quality figures: per-head delta heatmap, compounding curve,\n    allocation comparison。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    figures_generated: 3\n    heatmap_shows_l0_cluster: true\n    compounding_curve_shows_u_shape: true\n    allocation_chart_shows_over_allocation: true\n  result_rationale: '可视化是 paper 的 communication backbone。best 档下 reviewer 通过图理解三个核心\n    claim： (1) heatmap 立即可见 L0 cluster 的 spread pattern vs 其他架构的 flat/spike， (2) compounding\n    curve 的 U-shape 直观展示 k=8 sweet spot， (3) allocation comparison 清晰对比 unconstrained\n    (60% 2-bit) vs constrained (7% 2-bit) vs uniform (0% 2-bit)。 好的 figure 降低 reviewer\n    cognitive load，增加 acceptance probability。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Per-head 2-bit delta heatmap (layer × head) for Qwen — L0 cluster clearly\n    visible'\n  - 'Fig 2: PPL vs max_2bit sweep — Qwen U-shape, Llama flat, Mistral monotonic in\n    one panel'\n  - 'Fig 3: Stacked bar chart of bit allocation across methods (unconstrained / constrained\n    / uniform)'\n  analysis: Figures 是论文最重要的 communication tool。Fig 2 (compounding curve) 是 contribution\n    的 single best visualization。\n- name: Downstream task evaluation (Qwen)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'ARC-C / HellaSwag / PIQA / WinoGrande on Qwen2.5-7B at 4× compression。\n    验证 PPL improvement 转化为 downstream gain。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    arc_c:\n      uniform: 0.481\n      mckp: 0.514\n      delta_pp: 3.16\n    hellaswag:\n      uniform: 0.728\n      mckp: 0.768\n      delta_pp: 4.0\n    piqa:\n      uniform: 0.766\n      mckp: 0.779\n      delta_pp: 1.25\n    winogrande:\n      uniform: 0.662\n      mckp: 0.682\n      delta_pp: 1.97\n    avg_recovery_pct: 72.8\n    bf16_baseline_avg: ~0.699\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen 是 spread 型，PPL 提升 27.3% (15.45→10.91)。downstream 任务与 PPL\n    的相关性在 moderate compression 下通常成立。+1.25 到 +4.00pp 的 per-task gain 与 PPL gap 的 magnitude\n    一致——HellaSwag 和 ARC-C 对 KV cache quality 最敏感（需要 multi-hop reasoning），PIQA 最不敏感（常识判断，单步）。\n    72.8% avg recovery 意味着 constrained MCKP 恢复了从 baseline 到 uniform 4-bit 退化的 72.8%。\n    best 档下 reviewer 接受 downstream consistency 作为 PPL claim 的 validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Qwen2.5-7B Downstream (0-shot)\n    rows:\n    - task: ARC-C\n      bf16: 0.529\n      uniform_4bit: 0.481\n      mckp: 0.514\n      delta_pp: '+3.16'\n    - task: HellaSwag\n      bf16: 0.783\n      uniform_4bit: 0.728\n      mckp: 0.768\n      delta_pp: '+4.00'\n    - task: PIQA\n      bf16: 0.793\n      uniform_4bit: 0.766\n      mckp: 0.779\n      delta_pp: '+1.25'\n    - task: WinoGrande\n      bf16: 0.69\n      uniform_4bit: 0.662\n      mckp: 0.682\n      delta_pp: '+1.97'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: BF16 / Uniform / MCKP per task, with recovery % annotation'\n  analysis: 'Downstream eval 是 reviewer 必问项 (Q7)。Qwen 的 consistent gains across 4\n    tasks 验证 PPL→downstream 转化。 HellaSwag +4.00pp 是 headline downstream 数字。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen2.5-72B profiling (scale test)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: '在 72B 上运行 profiling-only。分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size scale。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: killed (GPU memory)\n    partial_result: L0 sensitivity pattern visible in partial profiling\n    paper_treatment: mentioned as future work\n  result_rationale: '72B profiling 在现有 GPU 资源下被 killed (OOM)。best 档下 reviewer 接受这是\n    resource limitation， 不是 methodological flaw。7B/9B/14B 的 cross-scale evidence (Qwen-7B,\n    Qwen-14B) 已经 demonstrate sensitivity pattern scales。72B 是 \"nice to have\"，论文中列为\n    future work。 reviewer 可能作为 minor revision 要求之一，但不影响 acceptance。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 72B 是 0-1 个 major objection 的 potential source。best 档下以 future work 处理。\n- name: K/V separation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 'K 和 V heads 作为独立 MCKP items。测试 K/V asymmetric budget 是否优于 joint K=V。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kv_sep_ppl: 11.22\n    joint_kv_ppl: 10.91\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    delta_sep_vs_joint: 0.3\n    sep_k_2bit_count: 16\n    sep_v_uniform_4bit: true\n    kv_asymmetric_heads: 21\n  result_rationale: 'K/V separation 在 Qwen 上略差 (+0.30 PPL)。原因：K heads 的 sensitivity\n    分布与 V heads 不同—— V heads 更 uniform (solver 将 V 全部留 4-bit)，K heads 有更多 heterogeneity\n    (16 个 2-bit vs joint 的 8 个)。 分离后 K side 过度分配 2-bit (少了 V heads 的 budget 共享 buffering)。best\n    档下 reviewer 认可 negative result：K/V joint optimization 更好，framework 自然 handles\n    K/V without asymmetric treatment。 这回答了 reviewer Q6 (\"RateQuant does K/V asymmetric\n    allocation, do you?\")。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: K/V Separation Ablation\n    rows:\n    - method: Joint K+V MCKP\n      ppl: 10.91\n      k_2bit: 8\n      v_2bit: 0\n    - method: Separate K/V MCKP\n      ppl: 11.22\n      k_2bit: 16\n      v_2bit: 0\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      k_2bit: 0\n      v_2bit: 0\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Negative result 但有 insight value：V heads 对 quantization 更 robust，K heads\n    更 sensitive。 Joint optimization 通过 budget sharing 自动 discovers 这一点。\n\n    '\n- name: L0-only heuristic baseline\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: '最简单的 non-uniform 策略：L0 全部 8-bit，其余 4-bit。以及 L0-constrained random\n    和 naive positional。 测试 MCKP 是否优于 trivial heuristics。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 10.91\n    l0_random_mean: 11.69\n    l0_random_std: 0.42\n    l0_random_median: 11.52\n    naive_positional_ppl: 12.23\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    mckp_vs_l0_random_median_gap: -5.2%\n    qwen_mckp_beats_all_heuristics: true\n    llama_mckp_ppl: 8.45\n    llama_l0_random_median: 10.04\n    llama_mckp_vs_l0_gap: -15.8%\n    mistral_mckp_ppl: 7.16\n    mistral_l0_random_median: 7.59\n    mistral_mckp_vs_l0_gap: -5.7%\n  result_rationale: 'L0-random (随机选 k 个非 L0 heads 放 2-bit) 在 Qwen 上 median 11.52 vs\n    MCKP 10.91。 MCKP 的 profiling-based 选择 consistently beats random by 5-16%。naive\n    positional (按 layer 顺序) 更差 (12.23)。关键 insight：L0 sensitivity 是 necessary but not\n    sufficient——MCKP 还需要正确选择 which non-L0 heads 放 2-bit。Llama 上 gap 更大 (15.8%) 因为只有\n    2 个 optimal 2-bit heads， random selection 容易选到 sensitive heads。best 档下 reviewer\n    接受 MCKP 优于 all tested heuristics， profiling 有 genuine value (在 benefit 存在的架构上)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Allocation Baseline Comparison (3 models)\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen\n      mckp: 10.91\n      l0_random_median: 11.52\n      naive: 12.23\n      uniform: 15.45\n    - model: Llama\n      mckp: 8.45\n      l0_random_median: 10.04\n      naive: 9.94\n      uniform: 8.47\n    - model: Mistral\n      mckp: 7.16\n      l0_random_median: 7.59\n      naive: 7.48\n      uniform: 7.13\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: MCKP / L0-random / Naive / Uniform across 3 models'\n  analysis: 'MCKP consistently outperforms all heuristics on all 3 models。但 Llama\n    和 Mistral 上 MCKP 仍不如 uniform， reinforcing Claim 3：profiling 只在 spread 型上有 net\n    value。\n\n    '\n- name: Greedy + cardinality constraint ablation (solver equivalence)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 'RateQuant greedy + max_2bit=8 vs MCKP + max_2bit=8。验证 constraint 是\n    primary intervention， solver choice 无关。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_constrained_ppl: 11.2312\n    mckp_constrained_ppl: 11.2312\n    delta: 0.0\n    greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 32.45\n    mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 36.92\n    bit_distribution_both:\n      2: 8\n      4: 100\n      8: 4\n    allocation_identical: true\n  result_rationale: '这是论文最重要的 ablation。Δ=0.0000 意味着 constrained greedy 和 constrained\n    MCKP 产生 IDENTICAL bit allocation。原因：cardinality constraint (k=8) 将 feasible set\n    缩小到 C(100,8)×C(8,4) 个可行解，在这个 reduced space 里 greedy 的 marginal gain ordering 与\n    MCKP 的 global optimal 收敛。unconstrained 下两者都 fail（但 mode 不同：greedy 32.45 vs MCKP\n    36.92）， constrained 下都 succeed 且完全一致。best 档下 reviewer 认可这是 \"constraint is THE\n    contribution\" 的最 powerful evidence——practitioners 不需要实现 MCKP，只需给现有 greedy 加一个参数。\n    A3 假设 (solver equivalence proves constraint is core) 完全成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Solver Equivalence (Qwen, k=8)\n    rows:\n    - solver: Greedy unconstrained\n      ppl: 32.45\n      2bit_heads: 68\n    - solver: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 36.92\n      2bit_heads: ~70\n    - solver: Greedy + max_2bit=8\n      ppl: 11.2312\n      2bit_heads: 8\n    - solver: MCKP + max_2bit=8\n      ppl: 11.2312\n      2bit_heads: 8\n    - solver: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      2bit_heads: 0\n  figures_description:\n  - '2×2 matrix: {unconstrained, constrained} × {greedy, MCKP} — the key figure showing\n    constraint is what matters'\n  analysis: 'Solver equivalence table 是 Claim 2 的 crown jewel。建议作为 Table 1 or prominently\n    in §4。 Reviewer 在 best 档下将 Δ=0.0000 视为 compelling evidence that \"the cardinality\n    constraint, not the solver, is the core contribution.\" 同时在 Qwen-14B 上 greedy=MCKP\n    (Δ=0.0000) 复现。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-seed error bars\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: '3 个不同 calibration seeds 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit on Qwen2.5-7B。\n    报告 mean±std。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mckp_mean: 10.99\n    mckp_std: 0.065\n    mckp_seeds:\n    - 11.02\n    - 10.9\n    - 11.05\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n    bit_dist_all_seeds: 2:8, 4:100, 8:4\n    allocation_agreement_3way: 0.902\n    pairwise_agreement_range:\n    - 0.911\n    - 0.946\n  result_rationale: 'std=0.065 在 mean=10.99 上是 0.59% CV——非常稳定。所有 3 seeds 产生 identical\n    macro allocation (2:8, 4:100, 8:4)，90.2% heads 在 3 seeds 间完全一致。不一致的 ~10% heads\n    是 sensitivity 接近的 mid-range heads (borderline 2-bit vs 4-bit)，对 PPL 影响 <0.1。uniform\n    是 deterministic (15.45)， MCKP mean 10.99 与 hires single-run 10.91 差 0.08——来自 calibration\n    data sampling variance。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 error bar 证明 robustness，不要求更多 seeds。\n    \"MCKP 10.99±0.065 vs Uniform 15.45\" 的 confidence interval 完全不重叠。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Multi-Seed Results (Qwen, 4×)\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0\n      mckp_ppl: 11.02\n      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n    - seed: 1\n      mckp_ppl: 10.9\n      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n    - seed: 2\n      mckp_ppl: 11.05\n      bit_dist: 2:8 4:100 8:4\n    - summary: Mean±Std\n      mckp_ppl: 10.99±0.065\n      bit_dist: identical\n    - reference: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 15.45\n      bit_dist: all 4-bit\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Error bar plot: MCKP (3 seeds) vs Uniform, with CI bands'\n  analysis: 'Error bars 是 reviewer 必问项。std=0.065 证明 single-run results 是 representative。\n    macro allocation 在 seeds 间 stable。remaining variance 来自 borderline heads 的 ordering。\n\n    '\n- name: Runtime/latency benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: '端到端 inference latency 和 throughput：mixed-precision KV cache vs uniform\n    4-bit vs BF16。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bf16_decode_ms: 33.78\n    uniform_4bit_decode_ms: 42.46\n    mckp_decode_ms: 46.09\n    mckp_solver_sec: 0.005\n    bf16_throughput: 29.6\n    uniform_4bit_throughput: 23.6\n    mckp_throughput: 21.8\n    theoretical_memory_4x_compression: true\n    mckp_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 8.5%\n  result_rationale: 'mixed-precision KV cache 比 uniform 4-bit 慢 8.5% (46.09 vs 42.46\n    ms/tok)。原因： per-head 不同 bit-width 需要 dynamic dequantization dispatch，而 uniform\n    可以 batch all heads 同一 kernel。MCKP solver 本身只需 0.005 sec (negligible)。memory 完全相同\n    (5.25 MB, 4× compression)。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 8.5% latency overhead 作为 reasonable\n    trade-off——PPL 从 15.45 降到 10.91 (29% improvement) 的代价是 8.5% latency。论文应该诚实报告 latency\n    overhead 而非隐藏。 reviewer 可能作为 minor revision 要求 longer-sequence latency 数据（长序列下\n    KV cache decode 是 bottleneck，overhead 比例可能变化）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Runtime Benchmark (Qwen, seq_len=2048)\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16\n      prefill_ms: 45.86\n      decode_ms: 33.78\n      throughput: 29.6\n      memory_MB: 21\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      prefill_ms: 54.25\n      decode_ms: 42.46\n      throughput: 23.6\n      memory_MB: 5.25\n    - method: Constrained MCKP\n      prefill_ms: 57.03\n      decode_ms: 46.09\n      throughput: 21.8\n      memory_MB: 5.25\n  figures_description:\n  - Latency breakdown bar chart with memory footprint overlay\n  analysis: 'Runtime benchmark 回答 systems reviewer concern。8.5% overhead 是 honest\n    cost。 但 long-context scenario (8K tokens) 是 deployment motivation：uniform 4-bit\n    at 8K degrades 11.15× while MCKP stays at 1.23× — the quality gap more than justifies\n    the latency cost. MCKP solver overhead (5ms) 是 one-time cost, amortized over entire\n    inference session.\n\n    '\n- name: Gemma-2-9B full pipeline\n  plan_id: gemma2_9b_full_pipeline\n  description: 'Gemma-2-9B (GQA 2:1, 336 KV heads) 完整 pipeline。最低 GQA ratio 的 anchor\n    point。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl: 6.03\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 6.17\n    constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.2\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.47\n    concentration: 0.23\n    distribution_shape: Flat\n    n_2bit_unconstrained: 106\n  result_rationale: 'Gemma-2 是 flat 型 (concentration=0.23, CV=1.28)。solver 无法区分 heads，unconstrained\n    将 106/336=31.5% heads 分到 2-bit。每个 head 的 per-head delta 很小但累积效应产生 1.47× degradation——\n    这是 \"moderate\" tier，不是 catastrophic 也不是 mild。best 档下 reviewer 要求 paper 讨论 three-tier\n    labeling (catastrophic 3.31× / moderate 1.47× / mild 1.07-1.08×)，这 strengthens\n    \"constraint 对所有架构都有价值\" 的 claim。constrained MCKP 将 2-bit 从 106 减到 8，PPL 6.20 vs\n    uniform 6.17—— delta 在噪声范围，确认 flat 型不需要 non-uniform。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Gemma-2-9B Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 6.03\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 6.17\n    - method: MCKP constrained (k=8)\n      ppl: 6.2\n    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 8.85\n      note: 1.47× baseline\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Gemma-2 的 1.47× moderate degradation 是论文需要主动讨论的 point。 它证明 constraint\n    即使在 flat 型上也有 value (106→8 2-bit heads)，strengthens universality claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Yi-1.5-9B full pipeline\n  plan_id: yi15_9b_full_pipeline\n  description: 'Yi-1.5-9B (GQA 8:1, 192 KV heads) 完整 pipeline。最高 GQA ratio 的 counterexample。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl: 7.02\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.22\n    hires_mckp_ppl: 7.22\n    unconstrained_degradation_ratio: 1.08\n    concentration: 0.71\n    distribution_shape: Spike\n    t1_t5: 0.9\n    l4h3_dominance: single outlier, 64% of total delta\n  result_rationale: 'Yi-1.5 是 spike 型 (L4H3 single extreme outlier, concentration\n    0.71 但 t₁/t₅=0.90)。 GQA 8:1 是所有测试模型中最高，但 benefit = 0%。原因：single outlier 不 create\n    optimization opportunity—— solver 给 L4H3 升 8-bit 后，剩余 heads 全部 near-identical\n    sensitivity，无法区分。 这 disproves \"higher GQA = more benefit\" naive hypothesis。best\n    档下 reviewer 认可 Yi-1.5 是 diagnostic 的 critical validation：concentration 0.71 >\n    0.50 threshold，但 t₁/t₅=0.90 > 0.70—— joint diagnostic 正确预测 \"no benefit\"。单用 concentration\n    会误判。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Yi-1.5-9B Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 7.02\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 7.22\n    - method: MCKP constrained (k=2)\n      ppl: 7.22\n    - method: Diagnostic prediction\n      result: No benefit (conc=0.71 BUT t₁/t₅=0.90 > 0.70)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: Yi-1.5 vs Qwen in (concentration, t₁/t₅) space — both high concentration\n    but different t₁/t₅'\n  analysis: 'Yi-1.5 是 Claim 3 的 strongest supporting evidence。GQA 最高但 benefit 最低——\n    joint diagnostic 的 necessity 因此建立。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-architecture compounding sweeps\n  plan_id: llama_compounding_sweep + mistral_compounding_sweep_v2 + qwen_compounding_sweep_v2\n  description: 'Llama, Mistral, Qwen 各自的 compounding sweep (PPL vs k)。三个 regime 对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_curve: U-shaped, optimal k=8, catastrophic k>32\n    llama_curve: Monotonic but gentle, k=0 optimal at 4×, catastrophic k>128\n    mistral_curve: Monotonic, k=0 optimal, catastrophic k>128\n    qwen_k8_degradation_pct: 2.4\n    llama_k8_degradation_pct: 1.7\n    mistral_k8_degradation_pct: 0.4\n    universally_safe_k: 8\n  result_rationale: '三种 curve 形状反映三种 sensitivity distribution： - Qwen (spread): k=8\n    释放 budget 给 L0 cluster → PPL 下降；k>8 compounding → PPL 上升 = U-shape - Llama (spike):\n    每增加一个 2-bit head 都轻微增加 PPL，但 sensitivity 分散所以增速慢 - Mistral (flat): 与 Llama 类似但更\n    flat，所有 head 贡献相似 compounding 关键：k≤8 在所有三种 regime 下 degradation < 2.5%，证明 k=8\n    是 universally safe threshold。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 3-architecture sweep 作为 constraint\n    parameterization 的实证基础。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Compounding Sweep Summary (k=8)\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen\n      k8_ppl: 10.05\n      baseline: 9.81\n      degradation_pct: 2.4\n      curve: U-shaped\n    - model: Llama\n      k8_ppl: 8.23\n      baseline: 8.09\n      degradation_pct: 1.7\n      curve: Monotonic gentle\n    - model: Mistral\n      k8_ppl: 7.06\n      baseline: 7.04\n      degradation_pct: 0.4\n      curve: Monotonic flat\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel compounding curve: Qwen / Llama / Mistral, with k=8 safe zone shaded'\n  analysis: 'Cross-architecture compounding sweep 是 universality claim 的 quantitative\n    backbone。 三种 curve 形状 + 一个 universally safe k = principled parameterization。\n\n    '\n- name: 8K long-context evaluation\n  plan_id: qwen7b_8k_context_eval\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 在 8K token context 下的 PPL 评估。Long-context amplification\n    effect。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ppl_bf16_8k: 6.97\n    ppl_mckp_8k: 8.59\n    ppl_uniform_4bit_8k: 77.75\n    mckp_degradation_ratio_8k: 1.23\n    uniform_degradation_ratio_8k: 11.15\n    degradation_gap: 9×\n    ppl_bf16_2k: 9.81\n    ppl_mckp_2k: 10.91\n    ppl_uniform_4bit_2k: 15.45\n  result_rationale: 'Long context 放大 2-bit compounding：uniform 4-bit 在 8K 下 PPL 77.75\n    (11.15× baseline)。 原因：每个 decode step 的 attention 覆盖更多 KV cache entries，2-bit quantization\n    error 在 longer attention span 上累积更多。constrained MCKP 通过保护 sensitive heads 在 higher\n    bit-width， 仅 1.23× degradation。9× gap in degradation rate 是 deployment motivation\n    的 headline 数字。 best 档下 reviewer 认可 long-context 结果作为 practical impact evidence——real\n    deployment 通常 operates at 4K-32K context，uniform 4-bit 在此范围内 unacceptable。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Long Context PPL (Qwen, 4×)\n    rows:\n    - context: 2K\n      bf16: 9.81\n      mckp: 10.91\n      uniform: 15.45\n      mckp_ratio: 1.11×\n      uniform_ratio: 1.57×\n    - context: 8K\n      bf16: 6.97\n      mckp: 8.59\n      uniform: 77.75\n      mckp_ratio: 1.23×\n      uniform_ratio: 11.15×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'PPL vs context length: MCKP stays flat while uniform 4-bit explodes — the deployment\n    motivation figure'\n  analysis: 'Long-context result 是 paper 的 deployment hook。\"11.15× vs 1.23×\" 在 abstract\n    中出现。 Reviewer 在 best 档下将此视为 constraint 的 practical value 的 strongest evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen-14B constrained pipeline + solver equivalence\n  plan_id: qwen14b_constrained_pipeline + qwen14b_greedy_constrained\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-14B (384 KV heads) 验证 scale generalization 和 solver equivalence。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl: 6.87\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 7.2\n    constrained_mckp_ppl: 7.22\n    unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 7.69\n    greedy_constrained_ppl: 7.22\n    delta_greedy_vs_mckp: 0.0\n    concentration: 0.33\n    shape: Flat\n    unconstrained_over_uniform: true\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B (384 heads, flat 型 concentration=0.33) 展示两点： (1) unconstrained\n    still fails (7.69 > 7.20 uniform)，即使在 14B scale (2) solver equivalence 完美复现 (greedy\n    constrained = MCKP constrained, Δ=0.0000) 14B 是 flat 型所以 non-uniform benefit ≈\n    0%，与 Claim 3 一致。 best 档下 reviewer 认可 14B 作为 scale validation + solver equivalence\n    的 second data point。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Qwen-14B Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16\n      ppl: 6.87\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 7.2\n    - method: MCKP constrained\n      ppl: 7.22\n    - method: Greedy constrained\n      ppl: 7.22\n      note: Δ=0.0000 vs MCKP\n    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 7.69\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Solver equivalence 在 14B 上完美复现，strengthens \"constraint makes solver irrelevant\"\n    universality。\n\n    '\n- name: Pythia-1.4B constrained pipeline\n  plan_id: pythia14b_constrained_pipeline\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B (MHA, 384 KV heads) 在非 GQA 架构上验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_ppl: 16.49\n    uniform_4bit_ppl: 24.29\n    constrained_mckp_ppl: 24.45\n    unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 31.54\n    delta_constrained_vs_uniform: -0.16\n    concentration: 0.24\n    shape: Flat\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia 是 MHA (non-GQA) 架构，384 KV heads，flat 型 (concentration=0.24)。\n    unconstrained 显著 fail (31.54 vs 24.29 uniform, 1.30×)。constrained 与 uniform 几乎持平。\n    best 档下 reviewer 认可：(1) compounding 不仅影响 GQA 架构，MHA 同样受害，strengthens universality；\n    (2) flat 型 non-uniform 无价值，consistent with diagnostic prediction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Pythia-1.4B Results\n    rows:\n    - method: BF16\n      ppl: 16.49\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit\n      ppl: 24.29\n    - method: MCKP constrained\n      ppl: 24.45\n    - method: MCKP unconstrained\n      ppl: 31.54\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Pythia 扩展 architecture coverage 到 MHA (GQA ratio 1:1)。8/8 unconstrained\n    degradation confirmed。\n\n    '\n- name: Phi-3-medium hires profiling\n  plan_id: phi3_medium_hires_profiling_v2\n  description: 'Phi-3-medium (400 KV heads) profiling。第 8 个架构，完成 8/8 universality。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    concentration: 0.17\n    t1_t5: 0.24\n    shape: Spread (low concentration)\n    cv: 0.89\n    top1_head: L9H6\n    total_heads: 400\n  result_rationale: 'Phi-3-medium concentration=0.17 (lowest in our test set)，但 t₁/t₅=0.24\n    suggests sensitivity spread across multiple mid-layer heads (L8-L11 cluster)。低\n    concentration + low t₁/t₅ 是 \"diffuse spread\" pattern——sensitivity exists but not\n    concentrated enough for MCKP to exploit at 4×。 best 档下这补全了第 8 个架构的 profiling data，支持\n    8/8 unconstrained degradation universality claim。 full constrained pipeline 未完成（资源限制），但\n    profiling pattern is sufficient for diagnostic validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Phi-3-medium Profiling Summary\n    rows:\n    - metric: Top-5% concentration\n      value: 0.17\n    - metric: t₁/t₅\n      value: 0.24\n    - metric: Distribution shape\n      value: Diffuse spread\n    - metric: Diagnostic prediction\n      value: No benefit at 4× (conc < 0.50)\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Phi-3-medium 是 diagnostic 的 edge case：concentration 低但 t₁/t₅ 也低。 Joint\n    diagnostic 预测 no benefit (concentration < 0.50)。9/9 accuracy 如果 full pipeline\n    确认。\n\n    '\n- name: CodeLlama-7B profiling\n  plan_id: codellama_hires_profiling\n  description: 'CodeLlama-7B (MHA, 1024 KV heads) profiling。Spike pattern validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    concentration: 0.8\n    t1_t5: 0.81\n    shape: Spike\n    top1_head: L1H1 (delta=23.0)\n    total_heads: 1024\n    diagnostic_prediction: No benefit (t₁/t₅=0.81 > 0.70)\n  result_rationale: 'CodeLlama 是 extreme spike：L1H1 delta=23.0，next head 仅 2.04。concentration\n    0.80 (highest tested) 但 t₁/t₅=0.81——single dominant outlier。与 Yi-1.5 (0.71/0.90)\n    类似的 spike pattern。 Joint diagnostic 正确预测 no benefit (t₁/t₅ > 0.70)。best 档下 reviewer\n    认可 CodeLlama 作为 concentration alone 不够的 second example (alongside Yi-1.5)，justifying\n    joint diagnostic。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: CodeLlama-7B Profiling\n    rows:\n    - metric: Concentration\n      value: 0.8\n    - metric: t₁/t₅\n      value: 0.81\n    - metric: Shape\n      value: Spike (L1H1 dominant)\n    - metric: Diagnostic\n      value: No benefit (conc>0.50 BUT t₁/t₅>0.70)\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'CodeLlama 与 Yi-1.5 形成 spike-pattern pair。两者都有 high concentration 但 high\n    t₁/t₅—— single outlier cannot be exploited by MCKP。9/9 diagnostic accuracy (9th\n    model)。\n\n    '\n- name: KIVI baseline comparison\n  plan_id: kivi_baseline_qwen_llama + kivi_baseline_qwen7b_v2\n  description: 'KIVI (per-channel group quantization) 作为 orthogonal baseline。验证 per-head\n    方法的 positioning。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_kivi_4bit_g32_r128: 9.9\n    qwen_kivi_4bit_g32_r0: 9.91\n    qwen_mckp_constrained: 10.91\n    qwen_uniform_4bit: 15.45\n    llama_kivi_4bit_r128: 8.14\n    llama_uniform_4bit: 8.47\n  result_rationale: 'KIVI 4-bit (g32, r128) 在 Qwen 上 PPL 9.90——比我们的 constrained MCKP\n    10.91 更好。 但两者是 orthogonal 且 complementary：KIVI 优化 per-channel group quantization\n    granularity， 我们优化 per-head bit-width allocation。best 档下 reviewer 理解 positioning：\n    (1) 我们的 contribution 是 compounding failure mode 的 discovery + constraint fix，不是\n    beat KIVI (2) KIVI + 我们的 constraint 可以 combine (per-head allocation + per-channel\n    group quantization) (3) KIVI 的 group quantization 减轻了 per-value quantization error，所以在\n    uniform bit-width 下更好 Paper 应清晰 position as complementary，不 compete on PPL numbers。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: KIVI Comparison (Qwen, 4×)\n    rows:\n    - method: KIVI 4-bit (g32, r128)\n      ppl: 9.9\n      approach: per-channel\n    - method: Constrained MCKP\n      ppl: 10.91\n      approach: per-head\n    - method: Uniform 4-bit (ours)\n      ppl: 15.45\n      approach: per-head\n    - method: BF16 baseline\n      ppl: 9.81\n      approach: —\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'KIVI 是 orthogonal method。论文 position：KIVI 优化 within-bit quantization\n    quality， 我们优化 cross-bit allocation + discover failure mode。两者 combine for further\n    improvement。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-architecture downstream eval (Yi, Llama, Mistral, Gemma-2)\n  plan_id: w3_downstream_eval + gemma2_downstream_k8_4task_v2\n  description: '5 个模型的完整 downstream eval (5 tasks, 0-shot)。验证 PPL→downstream consistency。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_avg_delta_vs_uniform: +1.92pp\n    yi_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.77pp\n    llama_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.99pp\n    mistral_avg_delta_vs_uniform: -0.48pp\n    gemma2_avg_delta_vs_uniform: +0.14pp (noise)\n    downstream_consistency_with_ppl: 5/5\n    arc_challenge_systematic_degradation: true\n  result_rationale: 'Downstream results 完美 mirror PPL patterns：Qwen (spread) 是唯一 consistent\n    gainer (+1.25 to +4.00pp)。 4 个 non-spread 模型显示 minor systematic degradation (Yi\n    -0.77, Llama -0.99, Mistral -0.48) 或 noise (Gemma-2 +0.14)。arc_challenge 是 worst-case\n    task (Yi -3.24pp, Llama -2.65pp)—— multi-step reasoning 对 KV cache error 最敏感。best\n    档下 reviewer 要求 paper 诚实报告 per-task tables 并讨论 arc_challenge 系统性信号，但接受 diagnostic\n    正确预测 downstream outcomes (5/5) 作为 Claim 3 的 strong validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Downstream Summary (5 models, 0-shot avg)\n    rows:\n    - model: Qwen (Spread)\n      delta_pp: '+1.92'\n      prediction: Benefit\n      correct: ✓\n    - model: Yi-1.5 (Spike)\n      delta_pp: '-0.77'\n      prediction: No benefit\n      correct: ✓\n    - model: Llama (Spike)\n      delta_pp: '-0.99'\n      prediction: No benefit\n      correct: ✓\n    - model: Mistral (Flat)\n      delta_pp: '-0.48'\n      prediction: No benefit\n      correct: ✓\n    - model: Gemma-2 (Flat)\n      delta_pp: '+0.14'\n      prediction: No benefit\n      correct: ✓\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-task heatmap: 5 models × 5 tasks, color-coded by delta vs uniform'\n  analysis: '5/5 downstream consistency 是 diagnostic 的 ultimate validation。论文必须： (a)\n    报告完整 per-task tables，(b) 用 \"shows minor degradation\" 不用 \"preserves accuracy\"，\n    (c) 主动讨论 arc_challenge 作为 worst-case。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen 3-seed downstream CI\n  plan_id: qwen_3seed_downstream_ci\n  description: '3 个 calibration seeds 的 downstream eval，提供 confidence intervals。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hellaswag_delta: +4.13pp\n    hellaswag_std: 0.0022\n    winogrande_delta: +1.58pp\n    winogrande_std: 0.0115\n    piqa_delta: +1.96pp\n    piqa_std: 0.0023\n    arc_challenge_delta: 0.00pp\n    arc_challenge_std: 0.0035\n    avg_delta: +1.92pp\n  result_rationale: '3-seed downstream CI 显示 low variance (std 0.002-0.012)。HellaSwag\n    和 PIQA 的 gain 是 robust (CI 不含 0)。arc_challenge delta=0 with std=0.0035 说明 arc_challenge\n    上 MCKP 和 uniform 差异 在统计噪声内——但 mean 仍正（与单 seed 的 +3.16pp 不矛盾，因为 3-seed 用了不同 calibration\n    data）。 WinoGrande std=0.0115 较高，反映 task 的 inherent variance。best 档下 reviewer 接受\n    3-seed CI 证明 downstream gains 是 robust，不要求更多 seeds。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 3-Seed Downstream CI (Qwen)\n    rows:\n    - task: HellaSwag\n      delta: +4.13pp\n      std: 0.0022\n      robust: ✓\n    - task: PIQA\n      delta: +1.96pp\n      std: 0.0023\n      robust: ✓\n    - task: WinoGrande\n      delta: +1.58pp\n      std: 0.0115\n      robust: ✓\n    - task: ARC-C\n      delta: 0.00pp\n      std: 0.0035\n      robust: borderline\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '3-seed CI 是 statistical credibility 的必要 evidence。HellaSwag/PIQA robust，\n    ARC-C borderline（可能需要 more seeds 作为 minor revision）。\n\n    '\n- name: W9 compounding scaling (top-k vs random-k)\n  plan_id: w9_compounding_v2\n  description: 'Compounding scaling test: top-k (most sensitive) vs random-k heads\n    at 2-bit。 证明 compounding 是 universal，不依赖 which heads selected。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k8_topk_ppl: 10.04\n    k8_randomk_mean: 11.07\n    k8_randomk_std: 0.69\n    k16_topk_ppl: 10.42\n    k16_randomk_mean: 12.91\n    k32_topk_ppl: 11.6\n    k32_randomk_mean: 18.33\n    k64_topk_ppl: 22.95\n    k64_randomk_mean: 55.94\n    compounding_ratio_k64_topk: 4.89\n    compounding_ratio_k64_randomk: 8.88\n  result_rationale: 'top-k 选最 sensitive heads 放 2-bit——每个 head 的 per-head impact 最大但\n    compounding 仍然发生。 random-k compounding 更严重因为随机可能选到 correlated heads（同一 layer 的多个\n    head 同时 2-bit 导致该 layer 的 representation 整体崩溃）。两者都展示超线性增长：k=8→k=64 的 PPL 增长远超\n    8× ratio。 best 档下这是 Claim 1 (non-additivity) 的 controlled experiment evidence：\n    如果 distortion 是 additive，random-k 应该 ≈ sum of individual deltas，但实际 8.88× > linear\n    prediction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Top-k vs Random-k Compounding\n    rows:\n    - k: 8\n      topk: 10.04\n      randomk_mean: 11.07±0.69\n      ratio_topk: 1.56×\n      ratio_randomk: 1.76×\n    - k: 16\n      topk: 10.42\n      randomk_mean: 12.91±0.40\n      ratio_topk: 1.56×\n      ratio_randomk: 2.10×\n    - k: 32\n      topk: 11.6\n      randomk_mean: 18.33±2.53\n      ratio_topk: 1.78×\n      ratio_randomk: 2.73×\n    - k: 64\n      topk: 22.95\n      randomk_mean: 55.94±9.73\n      ratio_topk: 4.89×\n      ratio_randomk: 8.88×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Log-scale PPL vs k: top-k vs random-k with variance bands — superlinear growth\n    = non-additivity evidence'\n  analysis: Top-k vs random-k 是 non-additivity 的 cleanest experimental evidence。 Random-k\n    的 higher variance 和 worse mean 说明 head selection matters —— 但即使 top-k (best case)\n    也展示 compounding。这支持 \"constraint is needed regardless of solver quality\"。\n","numLines":1307,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1307}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016vGVfKricmR1YTKkuyRno9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read the full paper (8 pages) and the review context file. Let me now dispatch the two reviewers and run the full roundtable process.\n\nLet me summarize what I've read:\n\n**Paper**: \"Cardinality-Constrained KV Cache Quantization: Preventing 2-Bit Compounding Failures on Hardware-Aligned Bit-Widths\"\n\n**Three claims**:\n1. 2-bit compounding is universal — independent per-head profiling underestimates joint distortion, all unconstrained solvers over-allocate 2-bit heads and underperform uniform 4-bit across 8/8 architectures\n\n\n2. Adding a cardinality constraint limiting 2-bit heads to k makes solver choice irrelevant, with greedy and MCKP approaches converging to identical solutions\n3. Non-uniform quantization rarely helps — only 1 of 8 architectures benefits at 4× compression, and a two-metric diagnostic using concentration and latency ratio thresholds correctly identifies when non-uniform approaches are worthwhile\n\n**Experiments**: Testing across 8 architectures including Qwen-7B, Llama-8B, Mistral-7B, Gemma-2-9B, Yi-1.5-9B, Pythia-1.4B, and others.\n\nNow I'm planning the evaluation scope: compounding effects, budget variations, long-context performance, downstream task transfer, confidence intervals across multiple seeds, oracle baselines, separate K/V quantization, heuristic comparisons, cross-dataset calibration, KIVI benchmarks, and runtime measurements. I need to verify which of these experiments are actually covered in the paper versus which ones I was imagining as part of the analysis. I'm splitting the review into two parallel tracks — one reviewer focusing on methods and experimental rigor, another on novelty and positioning relative to prior work.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_in